 for an Auto Link'=>'Iwọn kikọ ti o pọ julọ fun Auto Link','For example, \'4\' would only link terms that are of 4 characters or less in length.'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ, \'4\' yoo kan so mọ awọn ọrọ ti o jẹ ti awọn kikọ 4 tabi kere si ni gigun.','False'=>'Iro','True'=>'Otito','Whole words only'=>'Awọn ọrọ pipe nikan','Only add links when the term is an exact whole word match. Do not autolink partial matches.'=>'Kan fi awọn ọna asopọ kun nigbati ọrọ naa ba jẹ deede ọrọ pipe. Ma ṣe autolink awọn ibamu apakan.','Exclude terms from Auto Links'=>'Yọ awọn ọrọ kuro ninu Auto Links','If you enter the terms "WordPress", "Website" the Auto Links feature will never replace these terms. Separate multiple entries with a comma.'=>'Ti o ba tẹ awọn ọrọ "WordPress", "Website" ẹya Auto Links kii yoo rọpo awọn ọrọ wọnyi. Ya awọn akọsilẹ pupọ pẹlu koma.','Prevent Auto Links inside classes or IDs'=>'Dena Auto Links laarin awọn kilasi tabi IDs','Separate multiple entries with a comma. For example: .notag, #main-header'=>'Ya awọn akọsilẹ pupọ pẹlu koma. Fun apẹẹrẹ: .notag, #main-header','H1'=>'H1','H2'=>'H2','H3'=>'H3','H4'=>'H4','H5'=>'H5','H6'=>'H6','script'=>'script','style'=>'style','pre'=>'pre','code'=>'code','Prevent Auto Links inside elements'=>'Dena Auto Links laarin awọn eroja','Terms inside these HTML tags will not have Auto Links applied.'=>'Awọn ọrọ inu awọn aami HTML wọnyi ko ni Auto Links ti a lo.','Add links to synonyms'=>'Fi awọn ọna asopọ kun si awọn sinonimi','Add links to the term synonyms.'=>'Fi awọn ọna asopọ kun si awọn sinonimi ọrọ naa.','Add links for all terms'=>'Fi awọn ọna asopọ kun fun gbogbo awọn ọrọ','By default, PublishPress Taxonomies will add links for all terms. If this box is unchecked, Auto Links will only add links for terms that are attached to the post.'=>'Nipa aiyipada, PublishPress Taxonomies yoo fi awọn ọna asopọ kun fun gbogbo awọn ọrọ. Ti a ko ba ṣe aṣiṣe yii, Auto Links yoo kan fi awọn ọna asopọ kun fun awọn ọrọ ti a so mọ ifiweranṣẹ naa.','Use new Auto 