ọrọ tuntun ati ti o wa tẹlẹ silẹ laifọwọyi.','Search Auto Terms'=>'Wa Auto Terms','Add new terms and keep existing terms.'=>'Fi awọn ọrọ tuntun kun ki o si pa awọn ọrọ ti o wa tẹlẹ.','Add new terms and remove existing terms.'=>'Fi awọn ọrọ tuntun kun ki o si yọ awọn ọrọ ti o wa tẹlẹ.','Remove existing terms even if no new terms are found.'=>'Yọ awọn ọrọ ti o wa tẹlẹ paapaa ti ko ba si awọn ọrọ tuntun ti a ri.','Manage Auto Terms'=>'Ṣakoso Auto Terms','Edit Auto Terms'=>'Ṣatunkọ Auto Terms','Add new Auto Terms'=>'Fi awọn Auto Terms tuntun kun','To create more Auto Terms, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'Lati ṣẹda diẹ sii Auto Terms, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Auto Terms. You can create Auto Terms for any taxonomy.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le ṣẹda awọn Auto Terms ailopin. O le ṣẹda Auto Terms fun eyikeyi taxonomy.','Content'=>'Akọkọ','Sources'=>'Orisun','When to Use'=>'Nigbati lati Lo','Existing Content'=>'Akọkọ ti o wa','Preview'=>'Ṣayẹwo','Don\'t scan Post Content or Title'=>'Ma ṣe ṣe iwadii Akopọ Ifiweranṣẹ tabi Akọle','Find term in:'=>'Wa ọrọ ni:','Find in more areas:'=>'Wa ni awọn agbegbe diẹ sii:','Custom Field'=>'Custom Field','Search Taxonomy'=>'Wa Taxonomy','Post Types to scan:'=>'Iru Ifiweranṣẹ lati ṣe iwadii:','Add terms if synonyms found'=>'Fi awọn ọrọ kun ti a ba ri awọn ọrọ afiwera','PublishPress Taxonomies will add a term to the post if a synonym is found.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies yoo fi ọrọ kun si ifiweranṣẹ ti a ba ri afiwera.','Content statuses'=>'Ipo akoonu','Please choose an option for "Content statuses"'=>'Jọwọ yan aṣayan fun "Ipo akoonu"','Posts'=>'Posts','Schedule'=>'Iṣeto','Metaboxes'=>'Metaboxes','Run Auto Terms button'=>'Ṣiṣẹ bọtini Auto Terms','Show Run Auto Terms next to Add Post on the Posts screen. Runs this configuration on selected posts using its post settings, even when automatic processing on save is disabled.'=>'Fihan Ṣiṣẹ Auto Terms lẹgbẹẹ Fi Ifiweranṣẹ kun lori iboju Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ. Ṣiṣẹ iṣeto yii lori awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan nipa lilo awọn eto ifiweranṣẹ rẹ, paapaa nigbati ilana laifọwọyi lori fipamọ ba ti pa.','Enable Auto Terms when a post is saved or updated.'=>'Mọọ Auto Terms nigbati ifiweranṣẹ ba ti fipamọ tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Auto Terms Limit'=>'Iye Auto Terms','Limit the number of generated Auto Terms. \'0\' for unlimited terms'=>'Dín iye awọn Auto Terms ti a ṣẹda. \'0\' fun awọn ọrọ aiyé','Target content'=>'Akoonu afojusun','Only use Auto Terms on posts with no added terms.'=>'Lo Auto Terms nikan lori awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ko ni awọn ọrọ afikun.','Whole words'=>'Awọn ọrọ gbogbo','Only add terms when the word is an exact match. Do not make matches for partial words.'=>'Ṣe afikun awọn ọrọ nikan nigbati ọrọ naa ba jẹ ibamu gangan. Ma ṣe ṣe ibamu fun awọn ọrọ apakan.','Hashtags'=>'Hashtags','Support hashtags symbols # in Auto Terms.'=>'Ṣe atilẹyin awọn aami hashtags # ninu Auto Terms.','Auto Terms replacement settings'=>'Awọn eto iyipada Auto Terms','This option determines what happens when adding new terms to posts.'=>'Aṣayan yii pinnu ohun ti o ṣẹlẹ nigbati o ba nfi awọn ọrọ tuntun kun awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Enable Auto Terms for the "Schedule" feature.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ Auto Terms fun ẹya "Ipilẹṣẹ".','Only use Auto Terms on schedules with no added terms.'=>'Lo Auto Terms nikan lori awọn iṣeto ti ko ni awọn ọrọ afikun.','Enable Auto Terms for the "Existing Content" feature.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ Auto Terms fun ẹya "Akopọ Ti o wa".','Enable Auto Terms for the "Metaboxes" and the "Fast Update" feature.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ Auto Terms fun ẹya "Metaboxes" ati "Imudojuiwọn Yara".','Existing Terms'=>'Awọn Ọrọ Ti o wa','This will add existing terms from the taxonomy selected in the "General" tab.'=>'Eyi yoo fi awọn ọrọ ti o wa lati taxonomy ti a yan ni taabu "Gbogbogbo" kun.','Use all the terms in the selected taxonomy.'=>'Lo gbogbo awọn ọrọ ni taxonomy ti a yan.','Use only some terms in the selected taxonomy.'=>'Lo diẹ ninu awọn ọrọ nikan ni taxonomy ti a yan.','Please choose an option for "Sources"'=>'Jọwọ yan aṣayan fun "Awọn Orisun"','Choose the terms to use'=>'Yan awọn ọrọ lati lo','Choose the terms to use.'=>'Yan awọn ọrọ lati lo.','Show Term Post Count'=>'Fihan Iye Ifiweranṣẹ Ọrọ','This will show the number of posts attached to the terms.'=>'Eyi yoo fihan iye awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni asopọ si awọn ọrọ.','Exclude terms and keywords from Auto Terms'=>'Yọ awọn ọrọ ati awọn ọrọ-ọrọ kuro ninu Auto Terms','Enter comma-separated terms or keywords to exclude.'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ tabi awọn ọrọ-ọrọ ti a ya sọtọ nipasẹ koma lati yọ kuro.','a'=>'a','Prevent Auto Term inside elements'=>'Dena Auto Term ninu awọn eroja','Terms inside these HTML tags will not be used to generate terms.'=>'Awọn ọrọ inu awọn aami HTML wọnyi ko ni lo lati ṣẹda awọn ọrọ.','Exclude previously analyzed content'=>'Yọ akoonu ti a ti ṣe itupalẹ tẹlẹ','This enables you to skip posts that have already been analyzed by the Existing Content feature.'=>'Eyi fun laaye lati fo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti ṣe ayẹwo tẹlẹ nipasẹ ẹya Akopọ Ti o wa.','Limit per batches'=>'Iwọn fun awọn ẹka','This enables you to add Auto Terms to existing content in batches. If you have a lot of existing content, set this to a lower number to avoid timeouts.'=>'Eyi fun laaye lati fi Auto Terms kun akoonu ti o wa ni awọn ẹgbẹ. Ti o ba ni ọpọlọpọ akoonu ti o wa, ṣeto eyi si nọmba kekere lati yago fun awọn iṣoro akoko.','Batches wait time'=>'Akoko idaduro fun awọn ẹka','This is the wait time (in seconds) between processing batches of Auto Terms. If you have a lot of existing content, set this to a higher number to avoid timeouts.'=>'Eyi ni akoko idaduro (ni awọn aaya) laarin ṣiṣe awọn ẹka ti Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi. Ti o ba ni akoonu ti o wa tẹlẹ pupọ, ṣeto eyi si nọmba ti o ga julọ lati yago fun akoko idaduro.','24 hours ago'=>'Awọn wakati 24 sẹyin','7 days ago'=>'ọjọ 7 seyin','2 weeks ago'=>'ọsẹ 2 seyin','1 month ago'=>'osù 1 seyin','6 months ago'=>'oṣù 6 seyin','1 year ago'=>'ọdún 1 seyin','No limit'=>'Ko si ihamọ','Limit Auto Terms, based on published date'=>'Limiti Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi, da lori ọjọ ti a tẹjade','This setting allows you to add Auto Terms only to recent content.'=>'Eyi n gba ọ laaye lati fi Auto Terms kun akoonu tuntun nikan.','Add Auto Terms to existing content'=>'Fi Auto Terms kun akoonu ti o wa','Click the button to add Auto Terms to existing content.'=>'Tẹ bọtini lati fi Auto Terms kun akoonu ti o wa.','Save changes to the settings before using this feature.'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada si awọn eto ṣaaju lilo ẹya yii.','Select...'=>'Yan...','Show debug information'=>'Fihan alaye ayẹwo','Display sanitized request and response data for each enabled source.'=>'Fihan ibeere ti a sanitize ati data idahun fun ọkọọkan orisun ti a mu ṣiṣẹ.','Debug information'=>'Alaye ayẹwo','Request'=>'Ibeere','Response'=>'Idahun','No source debug data was returned for this preview request.'=>'Ko si data ayẹwo orisun ti a pada fun ibeere ifihan yii.','Copy request'=>'Da ibeere kopani','Copy response'=>'Daakọ idahun','Copy all'=>'Daakọ gbogbo','Download JSON'=>'Gba JSON','Debug information copied to the clipboard.'=>'Alaye iṣoro ti daakọ si clipboard.','The debug information could not be copied. Please try again.'=>'A ko le daakọ alaye iṣoro. Jọwọ tun gbiyanju.','Save Auto Terms'=>'Fipamọ Auto Terms','Add Auto Terms'=>'Ṣe afikun Auto Terms','Auto Terms Existing'=>'Auto Terms ti o wa','An error occured.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan ṣẹlẹ.','Auto Terms Existing Content'=>'Akọkọ akoonu Auto Terms ti o wa','This feature can scan your existing content and automatically assign new and existing terms.'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe yii le ṣayẹwo akoonu ti o wa ati laifọwọyi fi awọn ọrọ tuntun ati ti o wa silẹ.','Select an option...'=>'Yan aṣayan kan...','Auto Terms setting'=>'Eto Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi','Select an Auto Terms configuration to use when scanning content.'=>'Yan iṣeto Auto Terms lati lo nigba ti o ba n ṣayẹwo akoonu.','This enables you to add Terms to existing content in batches. If you have a lot of existing content, set this to a lower number to avoid timeouts.'=>'Eyi fun ọ laaye lati fi awọn ọrọ kun akoonu ti o wa ni awọn ẹgbẹ. Ti o ba ni akoonu ti o wa pupọ, ṣeto eyi si nọmba kekere lati yago fun akoko pipẹ.','This setting allows you to add Terms only to recent content.'=>'Iṣeto yii gba ọ laaye lati fi awọn ọrọ kun si akoonu tuntun nikan.','Save Settings'=>'Fipamọ Eto','Results'=>'Abajade','You can see full log details on the %1s screen'=>'O le rii awọn alaye igbasilẹ kikun lori iboju %1s','Tag Cloud'=>'Bulọọgi Tag','Tags Cloud'=>'Bulọọgi Tags','Select all terms'=>'Yan gbogbo awọn ọrọ','Name'=>'Orukọ','Slug'=>'Slug','Count'=>'Iye','No term avaliable.'=>'Ko si ọrọ ti o wa.','Select term %s'=>'Yan ọrọ %s','Taxonomies'=>'taxonomies','Registration key'=>'bọtini iforukọsilẹ','Description'=>'Apejuwe','Active'=>'Iṣe','Order'=>'Ibere','Edited'=>'Ti a satunkọ','No taxonomies found.'=>'Ko si taxonomies ti a rii.','View'=>'Wo','WordPress core'=>'WordPress core','PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies','A readable CSV stream is required.'=>'Iru CSV ti a le ka ni a nilo.','The CSV file could not be read.'=>'A ko le ka faili CSV naa.','The CSV file exceeds the 5 MiB import limit.'=>'Faili CSV naa kọja iwọn gbigbe 5 MiB.','CSV record 1 contains invalid TaxoPress transfer metadata.'=>'Akiyesi CSV 1 ni metadata gbigbe TaxoPress ti ko tọ.','This CSV was exported for taxonomy "%1$s" and post type "%2$s". Change the selection to match before importing.'=>'CSV yii ni a gbe jade fun taxonomy "%1$s" ati post type "%2$s". Yi yiyan pada lati baamu ṣaaju gbigbe wọle.','CSV record %d must contain slug,name,description and may also contain post_ids or parent_slug,post_ids.'=>'Akiyesi CSV %d gbọdọ ni slug, orukọ, apejuwe ati pe o le tun ni post_ids tabi parent_slug,post_ids.','Column count must match the header exactly.'=>'Iye ẹka gbọdọ ba akọle mu ni deede.','CSV records cannot contain more than five columns.'=>'Akiyesi CSV ko le ni ju awọn ẹka marun lọ.','The CSV file exceeds the 5,000-term import limit.'=>'Faili CSV naa kọja iwọn gbigbe 5,000-term.','Malformed CSV quoting.'=>'Iṣeduro CSV ti ko tọ.','Unclosed quoted CSV field.'=>'Ibi CSV ti a ko tii pa.','Import requires an array of no more than 5,000 terms.'=>'Gbigbe nilo akojọ ti ko ju 5,000 ọrọ lọ.','Each term must have string slug, name, and description fields.'=>'Gbogbo ọrọ gbọdọ ni slug, orukọ, ati awọn aaye apejuwe.','Fields must contain valid UTF-8 without null bytes.'=>'Awọn aaye gbọdọ ni UTF-8 ti o tọ laisi awọn byte ofo.','Name and slug must be nonempty and usable.'=>'Orukọ ati slug gbọdọ jẹ ti ko ni ofo ati lilo.','Name and slug must each be at most 200 bytes; values are not truncated.'=>'Orukọ ati slug gbọdọ jẹ kọọkan ni o pọju 200 bytes; awọn iye ko ni ge.','Description must be at most 10,000 bytes.'=>'Apejuwe gbọdọ jẹ ni o pọju 10,000 bytes.','Slug must already be a canonical WordPress slug and cannot be "0".'=>'Slug gbọdọ ti jẹ slug WordPress ti o tọ tẹlẹ ati pe ko le jẹ "0".','Duplicate slug; first used in CSV record %d.'=>'Slug dídá; a lo akọkọ ninu iwe CSV %d.','parent_slug must be a string.'=>'parent_slug gbọdọ jẹ okun.','parent_slug can only be used with a hierarchical taxonomy.'=>'parent_slug le ṣee lo nikan pẹlu taxonomy ti o ni ilana.','parent_slug must be a different canonical WordPress slug.'=>'parent_slug gbọdọ jẹ slug WordPress ti o tọ ti o yatọ.','parent_slug must identify a term in this CSV file or an existing term in the selected taxonomy.'=>'parent_slug gbọdọ mọ ọrọ kan ninu faili CSV yii tabi ọrọ ti o wa tẹlẹ ninu taxonomy ti a yan.','Term parent relationships cannot contain a cycle.'=>'Ibatan obi si ọrọ ko le ni iyipo.','You do not have permission to assign terms in the selected taxonomy. No terms or assignments were written.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati yan awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy ti a yan. Ko si awọn ọrọ tabi awọn atokọ ti a kọ.','The file exceeds the 25,000 term-to-content assignment import limit.'=>'Faili naa kọja 25,000 opin gbigbe ọrọ si akoonu.','You do not have permission to edit content ID %d. No terms or assignments were written.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati satunkọ ID akoonu %d. Ko si awọn ọrọ tabi awọn atokọ ti a kọ.','The selected taxonomy is unavailable.'=>'Taxonomy ti a yan ko si.','The selected post type is unavailable or does not support the selected taxonomy.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan ko si tabi ko ṣe atilẹyin taxonomy ti a yan.','post_ids must be a pipe-delimited string of positive integer IDs.'=>'post_ids gbọdọ jẹ okun ti a pin pẹlu pipe ti awọn ID integer to dara.','Too many or oversized post IDs.'=>'Ọpọlọpọ tabi awọn ID ifiweranṣẹ ti o tobi ju.','Post IDs must be canonical positive decimal integers within the PHP integer range (no spaces, signs, leading zeros, or empty IDs).'=>'Awọn ID ifiweranṣẹ gbọdọ jẹ awọn integer to dara ti a tọka ti o wa laarin iwọn integer PHP (ko si awọn aaye, awọn ami, awọn odo to wa niwaju, tabi awọn ID ofo).','Duplicate post ID within this term record.'=>'ID ifiweranṣẹ dídá laarin igbasilẹ ọrọ yii.','The parent term could not be found after processing its CSV record.'=>'A ko le ri ọrọ obi lẹhin ti a ti ṣe ilana igbasilẹ CSV rẹ.','Some content assignments were skipped because the content was missing or incompatible. All valid terms and assignments were still imported.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn atokọ akoonu ni a fo nitori akoonu naa padanu tabi ko baamu. Gbogbo awọn ọrọ to wulo ati awọn atokọ ni a ti gbe wọle.','The assignment could not be verified after saving.'=>'A ko le ṣayẹwo atokọ naa lẹhin fipamọ.','Assignment to content ID %1$d failed: %2$s'=>'Atokọ si ID akoonu %1$d kuna: %2$s','A writable CSV stream is required.'=>'A nilo ṣiṣan CSV ti a kọ.','The CSV output could not be written.'=>'A ko le kọjade CSV naa.','A term could not be read during export. Please try again.'=>'A ko le ka ọrọ kan nigba gbigbe jade. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','You cannot read every associated content item. Export was cancelled without downloading a partial file.'=>'Iwọ ko le ka gbogbo nkan akoonu ti o ni ibatan. Gbigbe jade ti fagile laisi gbigba faili apakan.','A parent term could not be read during export. Please try again.'=>'A ko le ka ọrọ obi kan nigba gbigbe jade. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','CSV record %1$d: %2$s'=>'Igbasilẹ CSV %1$d: %2$s','You do not have permission to transfer terms for this taxonomy and post type.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati gbe awọn ọrọ fun taxonomy ati iru ifiweranṣẹ yii.','A POST request is required.'=>'Ibéèrè POST ni a nilo.','A temporary export file could not be created.'=>'A ko le ṣẹda faili gbigbe jade igba diẹ.','The export file could not be rewound.'=>'A ko le tun faili gbigbe jade naa.','An output buffer prevented a clean CSV download.'=>'Bọọlu jade kan daabobo gbigba CSV mimọ.','Output was sent before the download. Check other plugins and retry.'=>'Jade ni a ranṣẹ ṣaaju gbigba. Ṣayẹwo awọn afikun miiran ki o tun gbiyanju.','Upload failed. Choose a CSV file and check the server upload limit.'=>'Gbigbe ko ni aṣeyọri. Yan faili CSV kan ki o ṣayẹwo opin gbigba olupin.','Choose a genuine uploaded file with a .csv extension.'=>'Yan faili ti a gbe kalẹ gidi pẹlu itẹsiwaju .csv.','The CSV file could not be read or exceeds the 5 MiB import limit.'=>'A ko le ka faili CSV naa tabi kọja opin gbigbe 5 MiB.','The uploaded CSV file could not be opened.'=>'A ko le ṣii faili CSV ti a gbe kalẹ.','The term export failed.'=>'Gbigbe ọrọ kuna.','The term import failed. No changes were made.'=>'Gbigbe ọrọ kuna. Ko si awọn ayipada ti a ṣe.','The term import finished with errors. Some changes may have been applied.'=>'Gbigbe ọrọ pari pẹlu awọn aṣiṣe. Diẹ ninu awọn ayipada le ti ṣee lo.','The terms were imported, with some content assignments skipped.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti wa ni gbe wọle, pẹlu diẹ ninu awọn iṣẹ akoonu ti a kọja.','The terms were imported successfully.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti wa ni gbe wọle ni aṣeyọri.','Created: %1$d. Updated: %2$d. Skipped: %3$d. Errors: %4$d.'=>'Ti ṣẹda: %1$d. Ti ṣe imudojuiwọn: %2$d. Ti kọja: %3$d. Awọn aṣiṣe: %4$d.','Assignments added: %1$d. Assignments unchanged: %2$d.'=>'Awọn iṣẹ ti a fi kun: %1$d. Awọn iṣẹ ti ko yipada: %2$d.','Content assignments skipped: %1$d because %2$d content items were missing or incompatible.'=>'Awọn iṣẹ akoonu ti a kọja: %1$d nitori %2$d awọn nkan akoonu ti parẹ tabi ko baamu.','Error details (up to the first 100):'=>'Alaye aṣiṣe (de ọdọ awọn 100 akọkọ):','Export Terms'=>'Gbe Awọn ọrọ jade','Export all %1$s terms and their %2$s assignments to a CSV file. Unused terms and term hierarchy are included.'=>'Gbe gbogbo %1$s awọn ọrọ ati awọn iṣẹ %2$s wọn si faili CSV. Awọn ọrọ ti a ko lo ati ilana ọrọ ni a pẹlu.','Import Terms'=>'Gbe Awọn ọrọ wọle','Import %s terms from a CSV file created by this tool. Existing terms are matched by slug, and assignments are added without removing other terms.'=>'Gbe %s awọn ọrọ lati faili CSV ti a ṣẹda nipasẹ ọpa yii. Awọn ọrọ ti o wa tẹlẹ ni a ṣe afiwe nipasẹ slug, ati awọn iṣẹ ni a fi kun laisi yiyọ awọn ọrọ miiran.','Back up your site first. Content IDs must identify the same content on both sites. There is no automatic rollback.'=>'Ṣe afẹyinti aaye rẹ akọkọ. Awọn ID akoonu gbọdọ ṣe idanimọ akoonu kanna lori awọn aaye mejeeji. Ko si atunṣe aifọwọyi.','CSV file:'=>'Faili CSV:','Update the name, description, and parent of existing terms.'=>'Ṣatunkọ orukọ, apejuwe, ati obi ti awọn ọrọ ti o wa tẹlẹ.','Skip missing or incompatible content assignments.'=>'Kọja awọn iṣẹ akoonu ti o padanu tabi ko baamu.','Maximum file size: 5 MiB, 5,000 terms, and 25,000 content assignments.'=>'Iwọn faili to pọ julọ: 5 MiB, 5,000 awọn ọrọ, ati 25,000 awọn iṣẹ akoonu.','You can export these terms, but you do not have permission to import them.'=>'O le gbe awọn ọrọ wọnyi jade, ṣugbọn o ko ni aṣẹ lati gbe wọle wọn.','Separate tags with commas'=>'Ya awọn ami pẹlu awọn kẹkẹ','Run Auto Terms'=>'Ṣiṣe Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi','Auto Terms configuration'=>'Atunto Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi','Select at least one post first.'=>'Yan o kere ju ifiweranṣẹ kan akọkọ.','Posts processed: %1$d of %2$d.'=>'Awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti ṣe: %1$d ti %2$d.','Finished. Posts processed: %1$d. Posts with terms added: %2$d. Check Auto Terms Logs for details.'=>'Ti pari. Awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti ṣe: %1$d. Awọn ifiweranṣẹ pẹlu awọn ọrọ ti a fi kun: %2$d. Ṣayẹwo Awọn igbasilẹ Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi fun alaye.','Auto Terms stopped. The request failed; previously completed posts were not rolled back.'=>'Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti da. Ibeere naa kuna; awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti pari tẹlẹ ko ti yipada.','You cannot run Auto Terms on this post.'=>'O ko le ṣiṣẹ Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi lori ifiweranṣẹ yii.','This post cannot be processed.'=>'A ko le ṣe ilana ifiweranṣẹ yii.','This Auto Terms configuration is disabled or unavailable for this post.'=>'Atunto Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi yii ko ni agbara tabi ko wa fun ifiweranṣẹ yii.','This post status is not enabled in the Auto Terms configuration.'=>'Ipo ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni agbara ni atunto Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi.','Auto Terms is already processing this post. Please retry later.'=>'Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti n ṣiṣẹ lori ifiweranṣẹ yii tẹlẹ. Jọwọ tun gbiyanju nigbamii.','Auto Terms could not process this post. Check Auto Terms Logs for details.'=>'Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi ko le ṣe ilana ifiweranṣẹ yii. Ṣayẹwo Awọn igbasilẹ Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi fun alaye.','Counter'=>'Kọ́ńtà','Random'=>'Airotẹlẹ','Method for choosing terms'=>'Ọna fun yiyan awọn ọrọ','Ascending'=>'Iwọn','Descending'=>'Iwọra','Ordering for choosing terms'=>'Ilana fun yiyan awọn ọrọ','Maximum terms'=>'Awọn ọrọ to pọ julọ','Start typing to search'=>'Bẹrẹ kikọ lati wa','Edit this metabox'=>'Ṣatunkọ metabox yii','Click to display tags'=>'Tẹ lati ṣe afihan awọn ami','suggested terms'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti a daba','Click terms to add them to this %s'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ lati fi kun wọn si %s yii','Search terms'=>'Wa awọn ọrọ','Show existing terms'=>'Ṣafihan awọn ọrọ to wa tẹlẹ','Security check failed.'=>'Ìṣàkóso aabo kọ́lu.','No terms in your WordPress database.'=>'Kò sí ìpín kankan nínú ibi ipamọ́ WordPress rẹ.','No results from your WordPress database.'=>'Kò sí àbájáde kankan láti ibi ipamọ́ WordPress rẹ.','PublishPress Taxonomies: Manage Terms'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies: Ṣakoso Awọn ọrọ','Manage Terms'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Ọrọ','Permission denied!'=>'Aṣẹ kọ!','Security problem. Try again.'=>'Isoro aabo. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Missing valid taxonomy for work. Try again.'=>'Iwọn taxonomy to wulo ti ṣofo fun iṣẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','This feature allows you to import and export terms, and manage your content terms by adding, renaming, merging and deleting unused terms.'=>'Ẹya yii n gba ọ laaye lati gbe wọle ati gbe jade awọn ọrọ, ati lati ṣakoso awọn ọrọ akoonu rẹ nipa fifi, tun orukọ, apapọ ati piparẹ awọn ọrọ ti ko lo.','Import / Export'=>'Gbe wọle / Gbe jade','Add Terms'=>'Fi Awọn Ọrọ kun','Remove Terms'=>'Yọ Awọn Ọrọ kuro','Rename Terms'=>'Tun orukọ Awọn Ọrọ','Merge Terms'=>'Apapọ Awọn Ọrọ','Delete Rarely Used Terms'=>'Paarẹ Awọn Ọrọ Ti a Lo Kere ju','Manage Terms tools'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Ọpa Awọn Ọrọ','Assign one or more terms to content.'=>'Yan ọkan tabi diẹ ẹ sii awọn ọrọ si akoonu.','Apply to'=>'Lo si','All %s'=>'Gbogbo %s','Only content assigned to specific terms'=>'Kanye akoonu ti a yan si awọn ọrọ pato nikan','Only update content assigned to any of these terms'=>'Kanye imudojuiwọn akoonu ti a yan si eyikeyi ninu awọn ọrọ wọnyi nikan','Separate multiple terms with commas.'=>'Yato si ọpọlọpọ awọn ọrọ pẹlu awọn koma.','Terms to add'=>'Awọn Ọrọ lati fi kun','Enter one or more comma-separated terms.'=>'Tẹ ọkan tabi diẹ ẹ sii awọn ọrọ ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu koma.','Remove term assignments from content without deleting the terms.'=>'Yọ awọn atunto ọrọ kuro ni akoonu laisi piparẹ awọn ọrọ naa.','Terms to remove'=>'Awọn Ọrọ lati yọ','The terms remain available after their assignments are removed.'=>'Awọn ọrọ naa wa ni agbegbe lẹhin ti awọn atunto wọn ti yọ.','Change term names without changing their content assignments.'=>'Yipada awọn orukọ ọrọ laisi yipada awọn atunto akoonu wọn.','Current term names'=>'Awọn orukọ ọrọ lọwọlọwọ','New term names'=>'Awọn orukọ ọrọ tuntun','Enter comma-separated names in matching order.'=>'Tẹ awọn orukọ ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu koma ni aṣẹ ti o baamu.','Move content assignments to one destination term and delete the source terms.'=>'Gbe awọn atunto akoonu si ọkan ọrọ ibi-afẹde kan ki o si paarẹ awọn ọrọ orisun.','Source terms are permanently deleted after their assignments are moved.'=>'Awọn ọrọ orisun ni a yoo paarẹ ni pẹkipẹki lẹhin ti awọn atunto wọn ti gbe.','Merge method'=>'Ọna apapọ','Merge terms with different names'=>'Apapọ awọn ọrọ pẹlu awọn orukọ oriṣiriṣi','Merge duplicate terms with the same name'=>'Apapọ awọn ọrọ ẹda meji pẹlu orukọ kanna','Source terms to merge'=>'Awọn ọrọ orisun lati apapọ','Enter two or more comma-separated terms.'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ meji tabi diẹ ẹ sii ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu koma.','Destination term'=>'Ọrọ ibi-afẹde','Content assigned to the source terms will be reassigned to this term.'=>'Akọkọ ti a yan si awọn ọrọ orisun yoo tun yan si ọrọ yii.','Suggest Terms to Merge'=>'Ṣe iṣeduro Awọn Ọrọ lati Apapọ','Delete terms used fewer than the selected number of times.'=>'Paarẹ awọn ọrọ ti a lo kere ju nọmba ti a yan lọpọlọpọ.','Check how many terms will be affected before deleting. This action cannot be undone.'=>'Ṣayẹwo iye awọn ọrọ ti yoo ni ipa ṣaaju ki o to paarẹ. Iṣe yii ko le yipada.','Delete terms used fewer than'=>'Paarẹ awọn ọrọ ti a lo kere ju','times'=>'igba','Check Affected Terms'=>'Ṣayẹwo Awọn ọrọ ti o kan','Delete Terms'=>'Pa awọn ọrọ','Multiple merge suggestions selected'=>'Aṣayan ikopọ pupọ ti yan','You have selected multiple merge suggestions. All selected terms will be merged into a single new term.'=>'O ti yan awọn iṣeduro ikopọ pupọ. Gbogbo awọn ọrọ ti a yan yoo darapọ sinu ọrọ tuntun kan.','Cancel'=>'Fagilee','Continue'=>'Tesiwaju','Permission denied for this taxonomy.'=>'Aṣẹ ti kọ fun taxonomy yii.','No terms provided for merging!'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti a pese fun ikopọ!','No terms with the same name found.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ pẹlu orukọ kanna ti a ri.','Merged term(s) with the same name "%s". %d posts updated.'=>'O ti darapọ ọrọ(ọ̀rọ̀) pẹlu orukọ kanna "%s". %d awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ni imudojuiwọn.','No new term specified!'=>'Ko si ọrọ tuntun ti a sọ!','No new/old valid term specified!'=>'Ko si ọrọ tuntun/tuntun ti o wulo ti a sọ!','Term to merge and New Term must not contain same term.'=>'Ọrọ lati darapọ ati Ọrọ Tuntun ko gbọdọ ni ọrọ kanna.','No valid new term.'=>'Ko si ọrọ tuntun to wulo.','These terms do not exist and cannot be merged: %s'=>'Awọn ọrọ wọnyi ko si ati pe ko le darapọ: %s','No matching terms found to merge.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti o baamu ti a ri lati darapọ.','Failed to create the new term.'=>'Kò ṣẹlẹ lati ṣẹda ọrọ tuntun.','No other matching terms found to merge.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ miiran ti o baamu ti a ri lati darapọ.','No terms were merged (terms may not exist).'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti a darapọ (awọn ọrọ le ma si).','Successfully merged %1$d term(s) "%2$s" to "%3$s". %4$s posts updated.'=>'O ti darapọ %1$d ọrọ(ọ̀rọ̀) "%2$s" si "%3$s". %4$s awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ni imudojuiwọn.','Error. You need to enter a single term to merge to in new term name !'=>'Aṣiṣe. O nilo lati tẹ ọrọ kan ṣoṣo lati darapọ si orukọ ọrọ tuntun!','Similar spelling'=>'Bí a ṣe n kọ́ àfihàn','Sounds similar'=>'Dá bí a ṣe n kọ́','Shared words: %s'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti a pin: %s','One contains the other'=>'Ọkan ni o ni ekeji','Invalid taxonomy.'=>'Taxonomy ti ko tọ.','Please enter a valid term. Merge cancelled.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ ọrọ to wulo kan. Ikopọ ti fagile.','Merge successful'=>'Ikopọ ti ṣaṣeyọri','No term specified!'=>'Ko si ọrọ ti a sọ!','No valid term specified!'=>'Ko si ọrọ to wulo ti a sọ!','This term is not associated with any %1$s.'=>'Ọrọ yii ko ni nkan ṣe pẹlu eyikeyi %1$s.','Removed term(s) "%1$s" from %2$s %3$s'=>'Ti yọ ọrọ(ọ̀rọ̀) "%1$s" lati %2$s %3$s','Error. No enough terms specified.'=>'Aṣiṣe. Ko si awọn ọrọ to peye ti a sọ.','No term renamed.'=>'Ko si ọrọ ti a tun ṣe orukọ.','Renamed term(s) "%1$s" to "%2$s"'=>'Ti tun ṣe orukọ ọrọ(ọ̀rọ̀) "%1$s" si "%2$s"','Error. No enough terms for rename.'=>'Aṣiṣe. Ko si awọn ọrọ to peye fun tun ṣe orukọ.','No term deleted.'=>'Ko si ọrọ ti a pa.','%1s term(s) deleted.'=>'%1s ọrọ(ọ̀rọ̀) ti pa.','No new term(s) specified!'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ tuntun ti a sọ!','Invalid post type.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ ti ko tọ.','No term added.'=>'Ko si ọrọ ti a fi kun.','Term(s) added to %1s %2s.'=>'Term(s) ti wa ni afikun si %1s %2s.','Nonce verification failed.'=>'Ijẹrisi nonce kuna.','%d terms will be deleted.'=>'%d term(s) ni yoo parẹ.','No terms will be deleted.'=>'Ko si term(s) ti yoo parẹ.','Invalid number specified.'=>'Nọ́mbà ti a sọ jẹ́ àìtọ.','No term(s) specified for removal!'=>'Ko si term(s) ti a sọ fun yiyọ!','Term(s) does not exist.'=>'Term(s) ko si.','No matching term found.'=>'Ko si term ti o baamu ti a ri.','Term(s) removed from %1s %2s.'=>'Term(s) ti yọ́ kuro ni %1s %2s.','Mass Edit Terms'=>'Iwọn Iṣatunkọ Mass','%1$s %2$s(s) terms updated with success !'=>'%1$s %2$s(s) term(s) ti ṣe imudojuiwọn pẹlu aṣeyọri!','This feature allows users to quickly add or remove terms from multiple posts.'=>'Ẹya yii ngbanilaaye awọn olumulo lati fi kun tabi yọ term(s) ni kiakia lati ọpọlọpọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','All'=>'Gbogbo','Search post title and content'=>'Wa akọle ifiweranṣẹ ati akoonu','Search'=>'Wa','Show all dates'=>'Show gbogbo awọn ọjọ','Quantity&hellip;'=>'Iye&hellip;','Filter by term'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ term','All terms'=>'Gbogbo term(s)','Post title'=>'Akọle ifiweranṣẹ','Terms : %s'=>'Term(s) : %s','Update all &raquo;'=>'Imudojuiwọn gbogbo &raquo;','No content to edit.'=>'Ko si akoonu lati ṣatunkọ.','Dashboard'=>'dashboard','Terms'=>'Awọn ọrọ','No permission!'=>'Ko si aṣẹ!','Invalid nonce token!'=>'Nọ́mbà nonce ti a sọ jẹ́ àìtọ!','Error: wrong data'=>'Aṣiṣe: data ti ko tọ','Post tags'=>'Awọn afi ifiweranṣẹ','Change selection'=>'Yipada yiyan','Content type'=>'Iru akoonu','Please select a valid'=>'Jọwọ yan ọkan ti o yẹ','Select Default Post Thumb'=>'Yan Iboju Ifiweranṣẹ Aiyipada','Use this media'=>'Lo media yii','Edit the current setting.'=>'Ṣatunkọ eto lọwọlọwọ.','The request could not be completed. Please try again.'=>'Ibéèrè naa ko le pari. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','No terms will be deleted'=>'Ko si term(s) ti yoo parẹ',' terms will be deleted.'=>' term(s) ni yoo parẹ.','Checking terms...'=>'Nṣayẹwo term(s)...','An error occurred while checking terms.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan ṣẹlẹ nigba n ṣayẹwo term(s).','Permanently delete the affected terms? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Ṣe parẹ awọn term ti o kan lailai? Igbese yii ko le yipada.','Select a post to see a preview.'=>'Yan ifiweranṣẹ kan láti wo àtẹ́jade.','Auto Term ID missing. Kindly save the auto term before using this feature.'=>'ID term aifọwọyi ti padanu. Jọwọ fipamọ term aifọwọyi ṣaaju ki o to lo ẹya yii.','Merge has been cancelled.'=>'A ti fagile iṣọpọ.','Pause.'=>'Duro.','Merging terms. Please wait...'=>'Iṣọpọ awọn ọrọ. Jọwọ duro...','Merging %1$s terms attached to %2$s posts. Please wait...'=>'Iṣọpọ %1$s awọn ọrọ ti a so mọ %2$s awọn ifiweranṣẹ. Jọwọ duro...','Large dataset detected, terms will be merged in batches of 20!'=>'Iṣẹ data nla ti a ri, awọn ọrọ yoo wa ni iṣọpọ ni awọn ẹgbẹ ti 20!','No terms were merged.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti a ti iṣọpọ.','Batch %1$s of %2$s merged.'=>'Igbẹ %1$s ti %2$s ti iṣọpọ.','terms merged'=>'awọn ọrọ ti a ti iṣọpọ','posts updated'=>'awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe imudojuiwọn','All terms merged into "%s"'=>'Gbogbo awọn ọrọ ti a ti iṣọpọ sinu "%s"','Terms merged into "%s"'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti a ti iṣọpọ sinu "%s"','Some batches were skipped because they contained non-existent terms.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn ẹgbẹ ti kọja nitori wọn ni awọn ọrọ ti ko si.','Batch %1$s failed because it contained non-existent terms: %2$s'=>'Igbẹ %1$s kuna nitori o ni awọn ọrọ ti ko si: %2$s','AJAX error on batch'=>'Aṣiṣe AJAX lori igbẹ','Error on batch %1$s:'=>'Aṣiṣe lori igbẹ %1$s:','Search Posts...'=>'Wa Awọn 