lo widget "Iṣafihan Awọn ọrọ (Taxonomies Shortcode)" dipo.','Title:'=>'Akole:','Max tags to display: (default: 45)'=>'Max awọn aami lati han: (aiyipada: 45)','Order by for DB selection tags:'=>'Iṣẹlẹ nipasẹ fun awọn aami yiyan DB:','Term group'=>'Ẹgbẹ ọrọ','Counter (default)'=>'Ika (aiyipada)','Order for DB selection tags:'=>'Iṣẹlẹ fun awọn aami yiyan DB:','ASC'=>'ASC','DESC (default)'=>'DESC (aiyipada)','Order by for display tags:'=>'Iṣẹlẹ nipasẹ fun awọn aami iṣafihan:','Random (default)'=>'Aiyipada (aiyipada)','Order for display tags:'=>'Iṣẹlẹ fun awọn aami iṣafihan:','Font size mini: (default: 8)'=>'Iwọn font mini: (aiyipada: 8)','Font size max: (default: 22)'=>'Iwọn font max: (aiyipada: 22)','Unit font size:'=>'Iwọn font unit:','Point (default)'=>'Point (aiyipada)','Pixel'=>'Píksẹlì','Em'=>'Em','Pourcent'=>'Pourcent','Format:'=>'Format:','Flat (default)'=>'Flat (aiyipada)','List (UL/LI)'=>'Akojọ (UL/LI)','Ordinary List (OL/LI)'=>'Akojọ Aládàáṣiṣẹ (OL/LI)','Use auto color cloud:'=>'Lo awọ awọ aifọwọyi:','Font color mini: (default: #CCCCCC)'=>'Awọ font kekere: (aiyipada: #CCCCCC)','Font color max: (default: #000000)'=>'Awọ font pọ: (aiyipada: #000000)','Tag link format:'=>'Fọọmu ọna asopọ akọle:','Advanced usage:'=>'Lilo to ti ni ilọsiwaju:','What to show'=>'Ohun ti lati fihan','PublishPress Taxonomies Logo'=>'Ami PublishPress Taxonomies','Welcome to PublishPress Taxonomies, the WordPress taxonomy plugin'=>'Kaabọ si PublishPress Taxonomies, amugbooro taxonomy WordPress','This screen allows you to enable or disable PublishPress Taxonomies features.'=>'Ibi iboju yi n gba ọ laaye lati mu tabi pa awọn ẹya ti PublishPress Taxonomies.','This feature allows you to create new taxonomies and edit all the settings for each taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yii ngbanilaaye fun ọ lati ṣẹda awọn taxonomy tuntun ati satunkọ gbogbo awọn eto fun ọkọọkan taxonomy.','This feature allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'Ẹya yi n gba ọ laaye lati wa ati satunkọ gbogbo awọn ọrọ lori aaye rẹ.','This feature allows you to search for terms and see all the posts attached to that term.'=>'Iṣẹ yii gba ọ laaye lati wa awọn ọrọ ati lati wo gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o so mọ ọrọ yẹn.','Terms Display'=>'Afihan Awọn Ọrọ','This feature allows you to create a customizable display of all the terms in one taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yii n jẹ ki o ṣẹda ifihan ti a le ṣe adani ti gbogbo awọn ọrọ ni taxonomy kan.','Terms for Current Post'=>'Awọn ọrọ fun Ifiweranṣẹ Tẹlẹ','This feature allows you create a customizable display of all the terms assigned to the current post.'=>'Ẹya yi n gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda ifihan ti a le ṣe adani ti gbogbo awọn ọrọ ti a ti yàn si ifiweranṣẹ tẹlẹ.','This feature creates a display of similar posts. If a post has the terms “WordPress” and “Website”, Related Posts will display other posts with those same terms.'=>'Ẹya yi n ṣẹda ifihan ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o jọra. Ti ifiweranṣẹ ba ni awọn ọrọ “WordPress” ati “Website”, Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Jọra yoo fihan awọn ifiweranṣẹ miiran pẹlu awọn ọrọ kanna.','This feature automatically adds links to your chosen terms. If you have a term called “WordPress”, Auto Links finds the word “WordPress” in your content and add links to the archive page for that term.'=>'Ẹya yi n fi awọn ọna asopọ kun si awọn ọrọ ti o yan. Ti o ba ni ọrọ kan ti a npe ni “WordPress”, Awọn ọna asopọ Aifọwọyi yoo wa ọrọ “WordPress” ninu akoonu rẹ ki o si fi awọn ọna asopọ kun si oju-iwe ifiweranṣẹ fun ọrọ naa.','This feature allows you to quickly edit the terms attached to multiple posts at the same time.'=>'Ẹya yi n gba ọ laaye lati satunkọ awọn ọrọ ti a so pọ pẹlu ọpọlọpọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ ni akoko kan.','This feature allows you to add, rename, merge, and delete terms for any taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yi n gba ọ laaye lati fi kun, tun orukọ, darapọ, ati pa awọn ọrọ fun eyikeyi taxonomy.','Show All Existing Terms'=>'Fihan Gbogbo Awọn Ọrọ Tẹlẹ','Manage Post Terms'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Ọrọ Ifiweranṣẹ','Create Terms'=>'Ṣẹda Awọn Ọrọ','This post type has no taxonomies.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yi ko ni taxonomies.','%1s Metabox'=>'%1s Metabox','Enable the metabox on the %1s screen.'=>'Mu metabox ṣiṣẹ lori iboju %1s.','Metabox Features'=>'Awọn ẹya Metabox','Show Private Taxonomies'=>'Fihan Taxonomies Aladani','Add support for private taxonomies.'=>'Fi atilẹyin kun fun taxonomies aladani.','Default Taxonomy'=>'Taxonomy Aiyipada','%1s Metabox Filters'=>'%1s Awọn àlẹmọ Metabox','Enable filters in the %1s existing terms tab.'=>'Mu awọn àlẹmọ ṣiṣẹ ni taabu awọn ọrọ to wa tẹlẹ %1s.','Default Method for choosing terms'=>'Ọna Aiyipada fun yiyan awọn ọrọ','Default Ordering for choosing terms'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe Aiyipada fun yiyan awọn ọrọ','Default maximum terms'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn ọrọ aiyipada','Metabox Show Term Post Count'=>'Metabox Fihan Iye Ifiweranṣẹ Ti ọrọ','Show Term Slug'=>'Fihan Slug Ọrọ','Minimum term length'=>'Gigun ọrọ to kere ju','Specify the minimum length for new terms when creating terms.'=>'Ṣe afihan gigun to kere ju fun awọn ọrọ tuntun nigbati o ba n ṣẹda awọn ọrọ.','Maximum term length'=>'Gigun ọrọ to pọ julọ','Specify the maximum length for new terms when creating terms.'=>'Ṣe afihan gigun to pọ julọ fun awọn ọrọ tuntun nigbati o ba n ṣẹda awọn ọrọ.','Prohibited Characters'=>'Awọn Character Ti a Ko Gba','Enter characters that will be blocked when users add new terms inside the "Create Terms" box. For example: !@#$%&*()'=>'Tẹ awọn ohun kikọ ti a yoo dènà nigbati awọn olumulo ba fi awọn ọrọ tuntun kun inu apoti "Ṣẹda Awọn ọrọ". Fun apẹẹrẹ: !@#$%&*()','Allow users in the %1s role to use the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'Gba awọn olumulo ninu ipa %1s laaye lati lo metabox PublishPress Taxonomies.','Block Users from Creating New Terms'=>'Dènà Awọn olumulo lati Ṣẹda Awọn ọrọ Tuntun','Prevent users in the %1$s role from creating new terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'Dènà awọn olumulo ninu ipa %1$s lati ṣẹda awọn ọrọ tuntun ni metabox PublishPress Taxonomies.','Taxonomies in Metabox'=>'Taxonomies ni Metabox','Select the taxonomies that users in %1s role can manage in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'Yan awọn taxonomies ti awọn olumulo ni %1s ipa le ṣakoso ni Metabox Taxonomies PublishPress.','Remove Default Metaboxes'=>'Yọkuro Awọn Metabox Aiyipada','Remove default taxonomy metaboxes for users in the %1s role.'=>'Yọkuro awọn metabox taxonomy aiyipada fun awọn olumulo ni ipa %1s.','These settings control features on the Posts screen.'=>'Awọn eto wọnyi n ṣakoso awọn ẹya lori iboju Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ.','Terms Filter display:'=>'Ifihan Ifilter Awọn Ọrọ:','Term Name'=>'Orukọ Ọrọ','Term Name + Taxonomy Name'=>'Orukọ Ọrọ + Orukọ Taxonomy','Term Name + Taxonomy Slug'=>'Orukọ Ọrọ + Taxonomy Slug','This controls the details that appear in the "Terms Filter" display and can help if you have terms with similar names.'=>'Eyi n ṣakoso awọn alaye ti o han ninu ifihan "Ifilọlẹ Ọrọ" ati pe o le ṣe iranlọwọ ti o ba ni awọn ọrọ ti o ni orukọ ti o jọra.','Terms Filter taxonomy:'=>'Taxonomy ti Ifilter Awọn Ọrọ:','Public Taxonomies'=>'Taxonomies Awujọ','Private Taxonomies'=>'Taxonomies Ikọkọ','Public Taxonomies and Private Taxonomies'=>'Public Taxonomies ati Private Taxonomies','This controls the taxonomy terms that appear on the "Posts" screen.'=>'Eyi n ṣakoso awọn ọrọ taxonomy ti o han lori iboju "Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ".','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the primary or secondary term is added to a post, the other term can be added also.'=>'Eyi ẹya n jẹ ki o sopọ awọn ọrọ. Nigbati ọrọ akọkọ tabi ọrọ keji ba wa ni afikun si ifiweranṣẹ, ọrọ miiran le tun wa ni afikun.','Linked Terms Type:'=>'Iru Awọn Ọrọ ti a So:','2-way relationship. When the main term or secondary term are added to the post, other term will be added also.'=>'Ibasepo 2-ọna. Nigbati ọrọ akọkọ tabi ọrọ keji ba wa ni afikun si ifiweranṣẹ, ọrọ miiran yoo tun wa ni afikun.','Add the primary term, get the secondary term'=>'Fi ọrọ akọkọ kun, gba ọrọ keji','Add the secondary term, get the primary term.'=>'Fi ọrọ keji kun, gba ọrọ akọkọ.','Enable Taxonomies:'=>'Mu Awọn Taxonomies ṣiṣẹ:','This controls which taxonomies are available for the Linked Terms feature.'=>'Eyi n ṣakoso awọn taxonomy wo ni o wa fun ẹya Awọn Ọrọ ti a So.','This feature allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'Eyi ẹya n jẹ ki o ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ọrọ ti o ni ibatan si ọrọ kan. Ti PublishPress Taxonomies ba ṣe ayẹwo ak contenido rẹ ki o si ri synonym, yoo ṣiṣẹ bi ẹnipe o ti ri ọrọ akọkọ.','This controls which taxonomies are available for the Term Synonyms feature.'=>'Eyi n ṣakoso awọn taxonomy wo ni o wa fun ẹya Awọn Synonyms Ọrọ.','Enable Hidden Terms:'=>'Mu Awọn Ọrọ Tita silẹ:','This feature will hide terms that are infrequently used. These terms will be visible inside the WordPress admin area, but not on the front of this site.'=>'Eyi ẹya yoo pa awọn ọrọ ti a ko lo nigbagbogbo. Awọn ọrọ wọnyi yoo han laarin agbegbe admin WordPress, ṣugbọn kii ṣe lori iwaju aaye yii.','Minimum Usage for Hidden Terms:'=>'Iwọn Iwọn to kere fun Awọn Ọrọ Tita:','Set the minimum number of posts a term must be attached to. If you enter 5, any term used in fewer than 5 posts will be hidden across the site, and its archive page will redirect to the homepage.'=>'Ṣeto nọmba to kere ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ọrọ gbọdọ wa pẹlu. Ti o ba tẹ 5, eyikeyi ọrọ ti a lo ni kere ju awọn ifiweranṣẹ 5 yoo wa ni pa ni gbogbo aaye, ati pe oju-iwe akosile rẹ yoo pada si oju-iwe ile.','PublishPress Taxonomies loads CSS and JavaScript files on the frontend for features like Terms Display, Related Posts, and Terms for Current Post. If you disable these scripts, those features may not display correctly.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies n gbe awọn faili CSS ati JavaScript lori iwaju fun awọn ẹya bii Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ, Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan, ati Awọn Ọrọ fun Ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ. Ti o ba pa awọn iwe afọwọkọ wọnyi, awọn ẹya wọnyẹn le ma han ni deede.','Disable Frontend Scripts:'=>'Pa Awọn iwe afọwọkọ iwaju:','Check this to prevent PublishPress Taxonomies from loading CSS and JavaScript files on the frontend of your site.'=>'Ṣayẹwo eyi lati ṣe idiwọ PublishPress Taxonomies lati gbe awọn faili CSS ati JavaScript lori iwaju aaye rẹ.','Disable Admin Preview Scripts:'=>'Pa Awọn iwe afọwọkọ Aworan Iṣakoso:','Check this to prevent PublishPress Taxonomies from loading frontend CSS and JavaScript files in the WordPress admin area. This will break the preview functionality when editing Terms Display, Related Posts, and Terms for Current Post.'=>'Ṣayẹwo eyi lati ṣe idiwọ PublishPress Taxonomies lati gbe awọn faili CSS ati JavaScript iwaju ni agbegbe admin WordPress. Eyi yoo ṣẹgun iṣẹ ṣiṣe iṣaaju nigba ṣiṣatunkọ Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ, Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan, ati Awọn Ọrọ fun Ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ.','These settings control features on the Manage Terms screen.'=>'Awọn eto wọnyi n ṣakoso awọn ẹya lori iboju Ṣakoso Awọn Ọrọ.','Add Terms:'=>'Fi Awọn Ọrọ kun:','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while adding terms'=>'Mimu eyi ṣiṣẹ yoo gba awọn olumulo laaye lati rii slug nigba ti n fi awọn ọrọ kun','Remove Terms:'=>'Yọkuro Awọn Ọrọ:','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while removing terms'=>'Mimu eyi ṣiṣẹ yoo gba awọn olumulo laaye lati rii slug nigba ti n yọ awọn ọrọ kuro','Rename Terms:'=>'Tun Orukọ Awọn Ọrọ:','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while Renaming terms'=>'Mimu eyi ṣiṣẹ yoo gba awọn olumulo laaye lati rii slug nigba ti n tun orukọ awọn ọrọ','Merge Terms:'=>'Darapọ Awọn Ọrọ:','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while merging terms'=>'Mimu eyi ṣiṣẹ yoo gba awọn olumulo laaye lati rii slug nigba ti n darapọ awọn ọrọ','Mass Edit Terms:'=>'Mass Edit Terms:','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug in the Mass Edit Terms screen'=>'Mimu eyi yoo gba awọn olumulo laaye lati wo slug ninu iboju Mass Edit Terms','No tags for this post.'=>'Ko si awọn afi fun ifiweranṣẹ yii.','<a href="%post_permalink%" title="%post_title% (%post_date%)" style="font-size:%post_size%;color:%post_color%"> 
			                       %post_title% <br> 
			                       <img src="%post_thumb_url%" alt="%post_title%" height="200" width="200" class="custom-image-class" />
			                       </a> 
			                       (%post_comment%)'=>'<a href="%post_permalink%" title="%post_title% (%post_date%)" style="font-size:%post_size%;color:%post_color%"> 
			                       %post_title% <br> 
			                       <img src="%post_thumb_url%" alt="%post_title%" height="200" width="200" class="custom-image-class" />
			                       </a> 
			                       (%post_comment%)','<a href="%tag_link%" title="%tag_name_attribute%" class="st-post-tags t%tag_scale%" style="%tag_size% %tag_color%" %tag_rel%>%tag_name%</a>'=>'<a href="%tag_link%" title="%tag_name_attribute%" class="st-post-tags t%tag_scale%" style="%tag_size% %tag_color%" %tag_rel%>%tag_name%</a>','Shortcode entry successfully deleted.'=>'Iwọle shortcode ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Invalid post terms ID.'=>'ID awọn ofin ifiweranṣẹ ti ko tọ.','Automatic display'=>'Iṣafihan adaṣe','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Current Post'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ','Add New Terms for Current Post'=>'Fi awọn ofin tuntun kun fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Search Terms for Current Post'=>'Wa Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Manage Terms for Current Post'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Preview Terms for Current Post'=>'Ṣafihan Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Toggle panel'=>'Yipada panẹli','Edit Terms for Current Post'=>'Ṣatunkọ Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Add new Terms for Current Post'=>'Fi awọn ofin tuntun kun fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','To create more Terms for Current Post, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'Lati ṣẹda awọn ofin diẹ sii fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Terms for Current Post. You can create Terms for Current Post for any taxonomy and then display those Terms for Current Post anywhere on your site.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le ṣẹda awọn ofin ailopin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ. O le ṣẹda Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ fun eyikeyi taxonomy ki o si ṣe afihan awọn ofin wọnyẹn fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ nibikibi lori aaye rẹ.','Choose Terms'=>'Yan Awọn Ọrọ','Display'=>'Ṣafihan','Layout'=>'Ipele','Design'=>'Apẹrẹ','Display Format'=>'Fọọmu Ifihan','24 hours'=>'24 wakati','7 days'=>'7 ọjọ','2 weeks'=>'ọsẹ 2','1 month'=>'oṣu 1','6 months'=>'oṣu 6','1 year'=>'ọdún 1','Limit terms based on timeframe'=>'Dena awọn ọrọ da lori akoko','Order direction'=>'Itọsọna aṣẹ','Font size minimum'=>'Iwọn font kere julọ','Font size maximum'=>'Iwọn font to pọ julọ','Point'=>'Póntì','Percent'=>'Iṣooṣù','Unit font size'=>'Iwọn font ẹyọ','Enable colors for terms'=>'Mú awọn awọ ṣiṣẹ fun awọn ọrọ','Font color minimum'=>'Iwọn awọ font kere julọ','This is the color of the least popular term.'=>'Eyi ni awọ ti ọrọ ti o kere julọ ni olokiki.','Font color maximum'=>'Awọ font to pọ julọ','This is the color of the most popular term.'=>'Eyi ni awọ ti ọrọ ti o pọ julọ ni olokiki.','Attempt to automatically display terms'=>'Gbiyanju lati ṣe afihan awọn ofin laifọwọyi','PublishPress Taxonomies will attempt to automatically display terms in this content. It may not be successful for all post types and layouts.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies yoo gbiyanju lati ṣe afihan awọn ofin laifọwọyi ninu akoonu yii. O le ma ṣiṣẹ fun gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ati awọn akori.','Above post content'=>'Akopọ akoonu ifiweranṣẹ ti o wa loke','Below post content'=>'Akopọ akoonu ifiweranṣẹ ti o wa ni isalẹ','Automatic display position'=>'Ipo ifihan laifọwọyi','Choose whether automatically displayed terms appear above or below the post content.'=>'Yan boya awọn ofin ti a ṣe afihan laifọwọyi yoo han loke tabi ni isalẹ akoonu ifiweranṣẹ.','Maximum terms to display'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn ọrọ lati ṣe afihan','You must set zero (0) to display all post tags.'=>'O gbọdọ ṣeto odo (0) lati han gbogbo awọn aami ifiweranṣẹ.','Post term separator string:	'=>'Ọrọ asọtọ ti awọn ofin ifiweranṣẹ:	','Text to display before terms list'=>'Ọrọ lati fi han ṣaaju akojọ awọn ọrọ','Enter the text that should be display before terms list. This field accepts basic HTML.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ ti o yẹ ki o han ṣaaju akojọ awọn ọrọ. Aaye yii gba HTML ipilẹ.','Text to display after terms list'=>'Ọrọ lati fi han lẹhin akojọ awọn ọrọ','Enter the text that should be display after terms list. This field accepts basic HTML.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ ti o yẹ ki o han lẹhin akojọ awọn ọrọ. Aaye yii gba HTML ipilẹ.','Text to display if no terms found'=>'Teksti lati ṣe afihan ti a ko ba ri awọn ofin','Hide display output if no terms ?'=>'Tẹ awọn abajade ifihan ti a ko ba ri awọn ofin?','Terms for Current Post div class'=>'Kilasi div fun Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Term link format'=>'Fọọmu ọna asopọ ọrọ','You can use any of the tokens shown below or find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'O le lo eyikeyi ninu awọn ami ti a fi han ni isalẹ tabi wa alaye diẹ sii %1sin the documentation%2s.','Here are the tokens you can use for Terms for Current Post format'=>'Eyi ni awọn ami ti o le lo fun ọna kika Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','The URL of the tag'=>'URL ti afi','The name of the tag'=>'Orukọ ti afi','This provides rel tag markup'=>'Eyi n pese markup tag rel','it creates'=>'o ṣẹda','Replaced by the RSS tag link'=>'Ti rọpo nipasẹ ọna asopọ afi RSS','Replaced by the tag ID'=>'Ti rọpo nipasẹ ID afi','Replaced by the tag’s name, formatted for attribute HTML'=>'Ti rọpo nipasẹ orukọ afi, ti a ṣe apẹrẹ fun HTML','The description of the tag'=>'Apejuwe ti afi','The font size of the tag'=>'Iwọn font ti afi','The font color of the tag'=>'Awọ font ti afi','You can also add HTML elements to the formatting.'=>'O tun le fi awọn eroja HTML kun si ọna kika.','Exclude hidden terms from Current Post?'=>'Yọkuro awọn ofin ti a pa mọ lati Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ?','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free.
                                            The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'O n lo PublishPress Taxonomies Free. 
                                            Ẹya Pro ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ẹya ati atilẹyin diẹ sii.','Save Terms for Current Post'=>'Fipamọ Awọn ofin fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Add Terms for Current Post'=>'Fi Awọn ofin kun fun Ifiweranṣẹ Lọwọlọwọ','Shortcode: '=>'Shortcode: ','No terms found for this post.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti a ri fun ifiweranṣẹ yii.','Post Status'=>'Ipo Ifiweranṣẹ','Author'=>'Onkọwe','Terms Filter'=>'Àlẹmọ Ọrọ','Post Types Filter'=>'Àlẹmọ Iru Ifiweranṣẹ','All Post Types'=>'Gbogbo Post Types','No posts found.'=>'Ko si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ri.','Terms for Current Post (PublishPress Taxonomies)'=>'Awọn ọrọ fun Ipo lọwọlọwọ (PublishPress Taxonomies)','PublishPress Taxonomies Terms for Current Post Shortcode'=>'Awọn ọrọ PublishPress Taxonomies fun Ipo lọwọlọwọ Shortcode','Terms for Current Post are added on '=>'Awọn ọrọ fun Ipo lọwọlọwọ ni a fi kun si ','Select widget terms for current post.'=>'Yan awọn ọrọ widget fun ipo lọwọlọwọ.','No terms for current post shortcode available. Add new shortcode '=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ fun ipo lọwọlọwọ shortcode ti o wa. Fi shortcode tuntun kun ','Search Posts'=>'Wa Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ','Related Posts successfully deleted.'=>'Awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Related Posts not found.'=>'Ko si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan ti a ri.','Related Post'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni Ibatan','Current post type'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ','PublishPress Taxonomies Related Posts Shortcode'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Iṣọpọ Ifiweranṣẹ Shortcode','Related Posts are added on '=>'Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan ni a fi kun ni ','Select widget Related Posts.'=>'Yan widget Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan.','No Related Posts shortcode available. Add new shortcode '=>'Ko si shortcode Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan ti o wa. Fi shortcode tuntun kun ','Add New Related Post'=>'Fi Post ti o ni ibatan tuntun kun','The Related Posts feature works by checking for shared taxonomy terms. If your post has the terms “WordPress” and “Website”, then Related Posts will display other posts that also have the terms “WordPress” and “Website”.'=>'Iṣẹ Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan n ṣiṣẹ nipa ṣiṣayẹwo fun awọn ọrọ taxonomy ti o pin. Ti ifiweranṣẹ rẹ ba ni awọn ọrọ “WordPress” ati “Website”, lẹhinna Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan yoo ṣe afihan awọn ifiweranṣẹ miiran ti o tun ni awọn ọrọ “WordPress” ati “Website”.','Search Related Posts'=>'Wa Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','Manage Related Posts'=>'Ṣakoso Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','Preview Related Posts'=>'Ṣayẹwo Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','Edit Related Posts'=>'Ṣatunkọ Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','Add new Related Posts'=>'Fi awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan tuntun kun','To create more Related Posts, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'Lati ṣẹda awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan diẹ sii, jọwọ ṣe igbesoke si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Related Posts. You can create Related Posts for any taxonomy and then display those Related Posts anywhere on your site.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le ṣẹda awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan ailopin. O le ṣẹda Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan fun eyikeyi taxonomy ki o si ṣe afihan Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan wọnyẹn nibikibi lori aaye rẹ.','Display format'=>'Fọọmu ifihan','Hide title in output ?'=>'Ṣe ẹ ṣe ìhòǹtì akọle ninu abajade?','Title header'=>'Akọle akọsori','Maximum related posts to display'=>'Iwọn ti o pọ julọ ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan lati han','Specify the number of related posts to display.'=>'Ṣalaye nọmba awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan lati han.','Attempt to automatically display related posts'=>'Gbiyanju lati han awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan laifọwọyi','PublishPress Taxonomies will attempt to automatically display related posts in this content. It may not be successful for all post types and layouts.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies yoo gbiyanju lati han awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan laifọwọyi ninu akoonu yii. O le ma ni aṣeyọri fun gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ati awọn ọna kika.','Box List'=>'Akojọ Apoti','Unordered List (UL/LI)'=>'Akojọ ti a ko paṣẹ (UL/LI)','Ordered List (OL/LI)'=>'Akojọ ti a paṣẹ (OL/LI)','This setting allows you to customize the appearance of Related Post links. You can use any of the tokens shown below or find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'Iṣeto yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣe akanṣe iwo awọn ìjápọ Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni Ibatan. O le lo eyikeyi ninu awọn ami ti a fihan ni isalẹ tabi wa alaye diẹ ẹ sii %1sin the documentation%2s.','Related Posts format'=>'fọọmu Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni ibatan','Here are the tokens you can use for related posts format'=>'Eyi ni awọn ami ti o le lo fun fọọmu awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','The URL of the post'=>'URL ti ifiweranṣẹ','The title of the post'=>'Akole ti ifiweranṣẹ','The date of the post (this shows inside a tooltip)'=>'Ọjọ ti ifiweranṣẹ (eyi han ninu tooltip)','The number of tags used by both posts'=>'Iye awọn aami ti a lo nipasẹ mejeeji awọn ifiweranṣẹ','The number of comments on the post'=>'Iye awọn asọye lori ifiweranṣẹ','The ID of the post'=>'ID ti ifiweranṣẹ','A list of tags used by both the current post and the related post'=>'Akojọ awọn aami ti a lo nipasẹ mejeeji ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ ati ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','The post excerpt'=>'Apejuwe ifiweranṣẹ','The post featured image URL'=>'URL aworan ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe afihan','The post content'=>'Ak contenido ifiweranṣẹ','The post category'=>'Ẹka ifiweranṣẹ','The font size of the post'=>'Iwọn fonti ti ifiweranṣẹ','The color of the post title'=>'Àwọ̀ akọle ifiweranṣẹ','PublishPress Taxonomies will display related posts from selected post types.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies yoo han awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan lati awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan.','Text to display before posts list'=>'Texto lati han ṣaaju akojọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ','Enter the text that should be displayed before the posts list.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ ti o yẹ ki o han ṣaaju akojọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Text to display after posts list'=>'Texto lati han lẹhin akojọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ','Enter the text that should be display after the posts list.'=>'Tẹ ọrọ ti o yẹ ki o han lẹhin akojọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Limit related posts based on timeframe'=>'Ihamọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan da lori akoko','Least common tags between posts'=>'Awọn aami ti o wọpọ julọ laarin awọn ifiweranṣẹ','Most common tags between posts'=>'Awọn aami ti o wọpọ julọ laarin awọn ifiweranṣẹ','Older Entries'=>'Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Atijọ','Newer Entries'=>'Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Tuntun','Alphabetical'=>'Alphabetical','Inverse Alphabetical'=>'Inverse Alphabetical','Related Posts Order'=>'Iṣẹda Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni Ibatan','Text to show when there is no related post'=>'Ọrọ lati fi han nigbati ko si ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan','Hide output if no related post is found ?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ pa ifasilẹ rẹ ti ko ba si ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan ti a rii?','Related Posts div class'=>'Kilasi div ti Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni Ibatan','d.m.Y (e.g., 09.10.2024)'=>'d.m.Y (àpẹẹrẹ, 09.10.2024)','F j, Y (e.g., October 9, 2024)'=>'F j, Y (àpẹẹrẹ, Oṣù Kẹsan 9, 2024)','Y-m-d (e.g., 2024-10-09)'=>'Y-m-d (e.g., 2024-10-09)','m/d/Y (e.g., 10/09/2024)'=>'m/d/Y (e.g., 10/09/2024)','d M, Y (e.g., 09 Oct, 2024)'=>'d M, Y (e.g., 09 Oct, 2024)','Post date format'=>'Fọọmu ọjọ ifiweranṣẹ','Maximum characters of post content to display'=>'Iye awọn ohun kikọ ti akoonu ifiweranṣẹ lati han','Maximum number of categories'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn ẹka','You must set zero (0) to display all post categories.'=>'O gbọdọ ṣeto odo (0) lati han gbogbo awọn ẹka ifiweranṣẹ.','Maximum number of tags'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti awọn aami','Thumbnail (150x150)'=>'Thumbnail (150x150)','Medium (300x300)'=>'Medium (300x300)','Large (1024x1024)'=>'Nla (1024x1024)','1536x1536 (High Res)'=>'1536x1536 (Iye ti o ga)','2048x2048 (Ultra High Res)'=>'2048x2048 (Iye ti o ga julọ)','Thumbnail image resolution'=>'Iwọn ipinnu aworan thumbnail','Default post thumbnail'=>'Thumbnail ifiweranṣẹ aiyipada','Use Default Image'=>'Lo Aworan Aiyipada','Remove Image'=>'Yọ Aworan','Select the default %post_thumb_url% to be used when a post doesn\'t have a featured image.'=>'Yan %post_thumb_url% aiyipada lati lo nigbati ifiweranṣẹ ko ni aworan ti a ṣe afihan.','Save Related Posts'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni ibatan','Add Related Posts'=>'Fikun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ Ti o Ni ibatan','No related posts found.'=>'Kò sí ifiweranṣẹ tó ní ibatan tí a rí.','autotermsschedulelog'=>'autotermsschedulelog','autotermsschedulelogs'=>'autotermsschedulelogs','Select all scheduled auto terms logs'=>'Yan gbogbo awọn igbasilẹ ọrọ aifọwọyi ti a ti ṣeto','Schedule log is empty.'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ log ṣofo.','Select scheduled auto terms log %s'=>'Yan igbasilẹ ọrọ aifọwọyi ti a ti ṣeto %s','Auto Terms Schedule'=>'Àkóso Àwọn Ọ̀rọ̀ Aifọwọ́kọ','Schedule is disabled. Please enable a schedule frequency to run a test.'=>'Àkóso ti dènà. Jọwọ mu àkóso àbáṣiṣẹ́ ṣiṣẹ́ láti ṣe ìdánwò.','Scheduled the cron event %s to run now. The original event will not be affected.'=>'A ti ṣeto iṣẹ́ cron %s láti ṣiṣẹ́ báyìí. Iṣẹ́ àkọ́kọ́ kò ní ní ipa.','Schedule is not enabled for selected Auto Terms.'=>'Akojọ ti wa ni pipade fun Awọn ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti a yan.','This feature allows you to run the Auto Terms feature on a schedule. This is helpful if you regularly import content into WordPress. PublishPress Taxonomies can run on a schedule and add terms to your imported content.'=>'Iṣẹ yii n jẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ ẹya Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi ni akoko kan. Eyi wulo ti o ba n ṣe ẹyọkan akoonu nigbagbogbo sinu WordPress. PublishPress Taxonomies le ṣiṣẹ ni akoko kan ki o si fi awọn ọrọ kun akoonu ti o ti gbe wọle.','Select Auto Terms settings to use when running the "Schedule" feature.'=>'Yan awọn eto Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi lati lo nigba ti o ba n ṣiṣẹ ẹya "Akọkọ".','Do not run on a schedule'=>'Maṣe ṣiṣẹ ni akoko kan','Weekly'=>'Ọsẹ kan','Schedule Frequency'=>'Iwọn Akoko','Disable \'Do not run on a schedule\' to select schedule frequency.'=>'Pa \'Maṣe ṣiṣẹ ni akoko kan\' lati yan iwọn akoko.','This enables you to skip posts that have already been analyzed by the Schedule feature.'=>'Eyi n jẹ ki o foju kọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti ṣe itupalẹ tẹlẹ nipasẹ ẹya Akoko.','This enables your scheduled Auto Terms to run in batches. If you have a lot of content, set this to a lower number to avoid timeouts.'=>'Eyi n jẹ ki Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi rẹ ti a ṣe eto ṣiṣẹ ni awọn ẹka. Ti o ba ni akoonu pupọ, ṣeto eyi si nọmba kekere lati yago fun akoko idaduro.','This setting can limit your scheduled Auto Terms query to only recent content. We recommend using this feature to avoid timeouts on large sites.'=>'Eto yi le dinku ibeere Awọn Ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti a ti ṣeto rẹ si akoonu tuntun nikan. A ṣe iṣeduro lilo ẹya yii lati yago fun akoko idaduro lori awọn aaye nla.','Test Run'=>'Idanwo Iṣe','Recent Schedule Runs'=>'Awọn Iṣe Akoko Tuntun','Terms Display successfully deleted.'=>'Afihan Awọn Ọrọ ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Cloud'=>'Ibi ipamọ','WordPress Default'=>'WordPress Default','Table List'=>'Atokọ Tabili','Border Cloud'=>'Ibi ipamọ Ààlà','Parent / Child'=>'Iya / Ọmọ','Add New Terms Display'=>'Ṣe afikun Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ Tuntun','Search Terms Display'=>'Wa Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Manage Terms Display'=>'Ṣakoso Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Preview Terms Display'=>'Ṣayẹwo Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Move up'=>'Gbe soke','Move down'=>'Gbe silẹ','Edit Terms Display'=>'Ṣatunkọ Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ','Add new Terms Display'=>'Ṣe afikun Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ tuntun','To create more Terms Display, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'Lati ṣẹda diẹ ẹ sii Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Terms Display. You can create Terms Display for any taxonomy and then display those Terms Display anywhere on your site.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le ṣẹda Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ ailopin. O le ṣẹda Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ fun eyikeyi taxonomy ki o si fi awọn Ifihan Awọn Ọrọ wọle ni ibikibi lori aaye rẹ.','Hide title in output?'=>'Tọju akọle ninu abajade?','All post types'=>'Gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ','All Parent Terms'=>'Gbogbo Awọn Ọrọ Obi','Parent Term'=>'Ọrọ Obi','Display only Parent Terms'=>'Fihan awọn Ọrọ Obi nikan','Display only Sub-Terms'=>'Fihan awọn Sub-Ọrọ nikan','Display Parents and Sub-Terms'=>'Fihan Awọn obi ati Awọn ọrọ-ọrọ','Display Mode'=>'Fihan Ipo','Term selection mode'=>'Ipo yiyan ọrọ','Automatic'=>'Aifọwọyi','Display terms based on settings in the "General" tab.'=>'Fihan awọn ọrọ da lori awọn eto inu taabu "Gbogbogbo".','Custom'=>'Aṣ customized','Display only the specific terms entered in the "Custom terms to display" field below.'=>'Fihan nikan awọn ọrọ pato ti a tẹ sinu aaye "Awọn ọrọ aṣa lati fi han" ni isalẹ.','Combined'=>'Papọ','Display automatic terms plus any additional custom terms specified below.'=>'Fihan awọn ọrọ aifọwọyi pẹlu eyikeyi awọn ọrọ aṣa afikun ti a tọka ni isalẹ.','Custom terms to display'=>'Awọn ọrọ aṣa lati fi han','Enter terms (comma-separated) to display. Used in Custom and Combined modes.'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ (ti a ya pẹlu koma) lati fi han. Ti lo ninu awọn ipo Aṣ customized ati Papọ.','Minimum term usage'=>'Iwọn ọrọ ti o kere julọ','Only display terms used by at least this many content items. Set to 0 for no minimum.'=>'Fihan awọn ọrọ nikan ti a lo nipasẹ o kere ju awọn nkan akoonu pupọ bẹẹ. Ṣeto si 0 fun ko si kere julọ.','Exclude terms from terms display'=>'Yọ awọn ọrọ kuro ninu ifihan awọn ọrọ','Enter terms (comma-separated) to exclude from the terms display.'=>'Tẹ awọn ọrọ (ti a ya sọtọ pẹlu koma) lati yọkuro lati inu iṣafihan awọn ọrọ.','Exclude hidden terms from Terms Display?'=>'Ṣe yọ awọn ọrọ ti a pamọ kuro ni Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ?','Hide display output if no terms?'=>'Tẹsiwaju ifihan jade ti ko ba si awọn ọrọ?','This is the color of the least popular term'=>'Eyi ni awọ ti ọrọ ti o kere julọ popular','This is the color of the most popular term'=>'Eyi ni awọ ti ọrọ ti o pọ julọ popular','Term display div class'=>'Kilasi div iṣafihan ọrọ','This option allows you to change the format of your terms. You can use any of the tokens shown below. Find more details %1sin the documentation%2s.'=>'Yiyan yii gba ọ laaye lati yi fọọmu awọn ọrọ rẹ pada. O le lo eyikeyi ninu awọn ami ti a fihan ni isalẹ. Wa alaye diẹ ẹ sii %1sin the documentation%2s.','Terms Display format'=>'Ọna kika Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ','Here are the tokens you can use for Term link format'=>'Eyi ni awọn token ti o le lo fun ọna kika ọna asopọ Ọrọ','The URL of the term'=>'URL ti ọrọ naa','The ID of the term'=>'ID ti ọrọ naa','The weighted size of the term in the display'=>'Iwọn ti o ni iwuwo ti ọrọ naa ninu iṣafihan','The number of times the term is used'=>'Iye igba ti ọrọ naa ti lo','The font size for the term'=>'Iwọn font fun ọrọ naa','The font color for the term'=>'Color font fun ọrọ naa','The name of the term'=>'Orukọ ọrọ naa','The name of the term with any HTML stripped out'=>'Orukọ ọrọ naa pẹlu eyikeyi HTML ti a yọkuro','The description of the term'=>'Apejuwe ọrọ naa','Font size minimum must not be greater than Font size maximum value.'=>'Iwọn font ti o kere julọ ko gbọdọ jẹ diẹ sii ju Iwọn font ti o pọ julọ lọ.','Save Terms Display'=>'Fipamọ Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ','Add Terms Display'=>'Fi Iṣafihan Awọn Ọrọ kun','Invalid nonce'=>'Nonce ti ko tọ','Missing display ID.'=>'ID ifihan ti o padanu.','Invalid terms display configuration.'=>'Iṣeto ifihan awọn ọrọ ti ko tọ.','There are no terms in this taxonomy.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy yii.','Please provide a taxonomy to delete'=>'Jọwọ pese taxonomy kan lati pa','Please provide a taxonomy name'=>'Jọwọ pese orukọ taxonomy kan','Object'=>'Ohun','%s has been successfully added'=>'%s ti ṣafikun ni aṣeyọri','%s has failed to be added'=>'%s ti kuna lati fi kun','%s has been successfully updated'=>'%s ti ṣe imudojuiwọn ni aṣeyọri','%s has failed to be updated'=>'%s ti kuna lati ṣe imudojuiwọn','%s has been successfully deleted'=>'%s ti pa ni aṣeyọri','%s has failed to be deleted'=>'%s ti kuna lati pa','Nonce failed verification'=>'Iṣeduro nonce kuna','Please choose a different taxonomy name. %s is already registered.'=>'Jọwọ yan orukọ taxonomy oriṣiriṣi. %s ti forukọsilẹ tẹlẹ.','Please provide a post type to attach to.'=>'Jọwọ pese iru ifiweranṣẹ kan lati so pọ pẹlu.','Please choose a different post type name. %s matches an existing page slug, which can cause conflicts.'=>'Jọwọ yan orukọ iru ifiweranṣẹ miiran. %s baamu pẹlu slug oju-iwe ti o wa tẹlẹ, eyi le fa ikolu.','Please do not use quotes in post type/taxonomy names or rewrite slugs'=>'Jọwọ ma ṣe lo awọn ikọwe ninu awọn orukọ iru ifiweranṣẹ/taxonomy tabi tun kọ awọn slug','%s has been successfully imported'=>'%s ti wa ni aseyori ti a mu wa','%s has failed to be imported'=>'%s ti kuna lati jẹ a mu wa','Add new %s'=>'Fi %s tuntun kun','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','New %s'=>'Tuntun %s','View %s'=>'Wo %s','Search %s'=>'Wa %s','No %s found.'=>'Ko si %s ti a ri.','No %s found in trash.'=>'Ko si %s ti a ri ninu ikogun.','Popular %s'=>'Olokiki %s','Parent %s'=>'Iya %s','Parent %s:'=>'Iya %s:','Update %s'=>'Imudojuiwọn %s','New %s name'=>'Orukọ %s tuntun','Separate %s with commas'=>'Ya %s sọtọ pẹlu awọn komma','Add or remove %s'=>'Fi %s kun tabi yọ %s','Choose from the most used %s'=>'Yan lati inu %s ti a lo jùlọ','Kindly select an action in bulk action dropdown!'=>'Jọwọ yan iṣe kan ninu dropdown iṣe pọ!','Kindly select atleast one taxonomy to proceed'=>'Jọwọ yan o kere ju taxonomy kan lati tẹsiwaju','Taxonomy has been successfully deactivated'=>'Taxonomy ti wa ni deactivated ni aṣeyọri','Taxonomy has been successfully activated'=>'Taxonomy ti wa ni activated ni aṣeyọri','Taxonomy has been successfully deleted'=>'Taxonomy ti wa ni paarẹ ni aṣeyọri','Are you sure you want to delete this? Deleting will NOT remove created content.'=>'Ṣe o dajudaju pe o fẹ paarẹ eyi? Iparẹ kii yoo yọ akoonu ti a ṣẹda kuro.','Please select at least one post type.'=>'Jọwọ yan o kere ju ọkan post type.','Taxonomy slug cannot be numbers only.'=>'Taxonomy slug ko le jẹ awọn nọmba nikan.','Add New'=>'Fi Tuntun Kun','Search Taxonomies'=>'Wa Taxonomies','All Taxonomies'=>'Gbogbo Taxonomies','Invalid nonce. Request is not authorized.'=>'Nonce ti ko tọ. Ibeere ko ni aṣẹ.','You do not have permission to view terms in this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati wo awọn ọrọ ni taxonomy yii.','Unable to retrieve terms for this taxonomy.'=>'Ko le gba awọn ọrọ fun taxonomy yii.','Manage Taxonomy'=>'Ṣakoso Taxonomy','Edit Taxonomy'=>'Ṣatunkọ Taxonomy','Add new Taxonomy'=>'Fi Taxonomy tuntun kun','Permalinks'=>'Permalinks','Admin Area'=>'Ibi Isakoso','Other Labels'=>'Awon Aami Mẹta','REST API'=>'REST API','Deactivate or Delete'=>'Dena tabi Pa','Taxonomy Slug'=>'Taxonomy Slug','Slug has changed'=>'Slug ti yipada','Slug already exists'=>'Slug ti wa tẹlẹ','Special character not allowed in slug.'=>'A ko gba aami pataki laaye ninu slug.','The “slug” is the URL-friendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'“slug” ni ẹya URL-ore ti orukọ. O maa n jẹ gbogbo lẹta kekere ati pe o ni awọn lẹta, awọn nọmba, ati awọn aami isalẹ nikan.','DO NOT EDIT the taxonomy slug unless also planning to migrate terms. Changing the slug registers a new taxonomy entry.'=>'Ẹ má ṣe Ṣatunkọ slug taxonomy ayafi ti o ba tun gbero lati gbe awọn ọrọ. Iyipada slug naa forukọsilẹ ohun titun ninu taxonomy.','Migrate terms to newly renamed taxonomy?'=>'Gbe awọn ọrọ si taxonomy ti a tun pe ni tuntun?','(e.g. Jobs)'=>'(àpẹẹrẹ: Jobs)','Plural Label'=>'Aami Plural','(e.g. Job)'=>'(àpẹẹrẹ: Job)','Singular Label'=>'Aami Alailẹgbẹ','Parent-Child Relationships'=>'Ibasepọ Ẹbi-Ọmọ','Can terms in this taxonomy be organized into hierarchical relationships?'=>'Ṣe awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy yii le ṣeto sinu ibasepọ ilana?','Describe what your taxonomy is used for.'=>'Ṣalaye ohun ti taxonomy rẹ jẹ fun.','Default Terms'=>'Awọn Ọrọ Aiyipada','Set the default terms for this taxonomy. These will be automatically added to all new posts. Enter the term names or slugs. Separate multiple terms with by comma.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ọrọ aiyipada fun taxonomy yii. Awọn wọnyi yoo jẹ afikun laifọwọyi si gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ tuntun. Tẹ awọn orukọ ọrọ tabi awọn slugs. Ya awọn ọrọ pupọ pẹlu koma.','Archive page result'=>'Abajade oju-iwe Archive','Normally, WordPress will only show one post type on taxonomy archive pages. Enable this feature to show content from all selected posts types.'=>'Nigbagbogbo, WordPress yoo fihan iru ifiweranṣẹ kan nikan lori awọn oju-iwe archive taxonomy. Mu ẹya yii ṣiṣẹ lati fihan akoonu lati gbogbo awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a yan.','Rewrite'=>'Tun kọ','WordPress can use a custom permalink for this taxonomy. It does not have to match the slug.'=>'WordPress le lo permalink aṣa fun taxonomy yii. Ko ni lati ba slug mu.','(default: taxonomy name)'=>'(aiyipada: orukọ taxonomy)','Custom Rewrite Slug'=>'Slug Tun Kọ Aṣa','Custom taxonomy rewrite slug.'=>'Slug tun kọ aṣa fun taxonomy.','Rewrite With Front'=>'Tun Kọ Pẹlu Ibi iwaju','Should the permastruct be prepended with the front base.'=>'Ṣe permastruct yẹ ki o wa ni pejọ pẹlu ipilẹ iwaju.','Rewrite Hierarchical'=>'Tun Kọ Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe','Should the permastruct allow hierarchical urls.'=>'Ṣe permastruct yẹ ki o jẹ ki awọn URLs ilana?','Show user interface'=>'Fihan oju-iwe olumulo','Should there be a visible interface in the WordPress admin area to manage these terms?'=>'Ṣe yẹ ki o wa oju-iwe ti o han ni agbegbe admin WordPress lati ṣakoso awọn ọrọ wọnyi?','Show in admin menus'=>'Fihan ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan admin','Should there be links to this taxonomy in the WordPress admin menus?'=>'Ṣe awọn ọna asopọ si taxonomy yii wa ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan admin WordPress?','Show in frontend menus'=>'Fihan ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan iwaju','Should this taxonomy be available for the frontend “Menus” and “Navigation” options?'=>'Ṣe taxonomy yii yẹ ki o wa fun awọn aṣayan “Akojọ” ati “Iṣakoso” ni iwaju?','Show admin column'=>'Fihan ọwọn admin','Should a column for this taxonomy appear on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'Ṣe ọwọn fun taxonomy yii yẹ ki o han lori awọn iboju bii “Posts” ati “Pages”?','Show in "Quick Edit" and "Bulk Edit"'=>'Fihan ninu "Ṣatunkọ Yara" ati "Ṣatunkọ Ọpọlọpọ"','Should this taxonomy be available in editing tools on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'Ṣe taxonomy yii yẹ ki o wa ninu awọn irinṣẹ ṣiṣatunkọ lori awọn iboju bii “Posts” ati “Pages”?','Show in Filter'=>'Fihan ninu If фильtir','Should this taxonomy be available in filters on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'Ṣe taxonomy yii yẹ ki o wa ninu awọn if фильtir lori awọn iboju bii “Posts” ati “Pages”?','Menu Name'=>'Orukọ Akojọ','Custom admin menu name for your taxonomy.'=>'Orukọ akojọ admin ti aṣa fun taxonomy rẹ.','(e.g. All Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Gbogbo Iṣẹ)','All Items'=>'Gbogbo Awọn nkan','Used as tab text when showing all terms for hierarchical taxonomy while editing post.'=>'Lo bi ọrọ taabu nigbati o ba n fihan gbogbo awọn ofin fun taxonomy hierarchical nigbati o n ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ.','(e.g. Edit Job)'=>'(e.g. Ṣatunkọ Iṣẹ)','Edit Item'=>'Ṣatunkọ Nkan','Used at the top of the term editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'Lo ni oke iboju olootu ofin fun ofin taxonomy ti o wa tẹlẹ.','(e.g. View Job)'=>'(e.g. Wo Iṣẹ)','View Item'=>'Wo Nkan','Used in the admin bar when viewing editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'Lo ninu bar admin nigbati o ba wo iboju olootu fun ọrọ taxonomy ti o wa.','(e.g. Update Job Name)'=>'(e.g. Ṣatunkọ Orukọ Iṣẹ)','Update Item Name'=>'Ṣatunkọ Orukọ Ohun','Custom taxonomy label. Used in the admin menu for displaying taxonomies.'=>'Aami taxonomy aṣa. Lo ninu akojọ aṣayan admin fun ifihan taxonomies.','Update %s name'=>'Ṣatunkọ orukọ %s','(e.g. Add New Job)'=>'(e.g. Fi Iṣẹ Tuntun Kún)','Add New Item'=>'Fi Ohun Tuntun Kún','Used at the top of the term editor screen and button text for a new taxonomy term.'=>'Lo ni oke iboju olootu ọrọ ati ọrọ bọtini fun ọrọ taxonomy tuntun.','(e.g. New Job Name)'=>'(e.g. Orukọ Iṣẹ Tuntun)','New Item Name'=>'Orukọ Ohun Tuntun','(e.g. Parent Job)'=>'(e.g. Iṣẹ Obi)','Parent Item'=>'Ohun Obi','(e.g. Parent Job:)'=>'(e.g. Iṣẹ Obi:)','Parent Item Colon'=>'Kolon Ohun Obi','(e.g. Search Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Wa Awọn Iṣẹ)','Search Items'=>'Wa Awọn Ohun','(e.g. Popular Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Awọn Iṣẹ Olokiki)','Popular Items'=>'Awọn Ohun Olokiki','(e.g. Separate Jobs with commas)'=>'(e.g. Ya Awọn Iṣẹ pẹlu awọn koma)','Separate Items with Commas'=>'Ya Awọn Ohun pẹlu Awọn Koma','(e.g. Add or remove Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Fi kun tabi yọ Jobs)','Add or Remove Items'=>'Fi kun tabi Yọ Items','(e.g. Choose from the most used Jobs)'=>'(e.g. Yan lati inu Jobs ti a lo julọ)','Choose From Most Used'=>'Yan Lati Inu Ti A Lo Jùlọ','(e.g. No jobs)'=>'(e.g. Ko si Jobs)','No terms'=>'Ko si awọn ofin','Used when indicating that there are no terms in the given taxonomy associated with an object.'=>'Lo nigba ti o ba tọka pe ko si awọn ofin ninu taxonomy ti a fun ni ti a so pọ pẹlu ohun kan.','No %s'=>'Ko si %s','(e.g. Jobs list navigation)'=>'(e.g. naviagtion atokọ Jobs)','Items List Navigation'=>'Navigation Atokọ Items','Screen reader text for the pagination heading on the term listing screen.'=>'Ọrọ ti a fi han nipasẹ titẹ ‘Yan lati inu awọn ohun ti a lo julọ’ ninu apo meta taxonomy nigbati ko si awọn ohun ti o wa.','%s list navigation'=>'%s navigation atokọ','(e.g. Jobs list)'=>'(e.g. atokọ Jobs)','Items List'=>'Atokọ Items','Screen reader text for the items list heading on the term listing screen.'=>'Ọrọ ti a fi han fun akọle atokọ awọn ohun lori iboju atokọ awọn ofin.','%s list'=>'%s atokọ','(e.g. No jobs found)'=>'(e.g. Ko si jobs ti a ri)','Not Found'=>'Ko ri','The text displayed via clicking ‘Choose from the most used items’ in the taxonomy meta box when no items are available.'=>'Ọrọ ti a fi han nipa titẹ ‘Yan lati inu awọn ohun ti a lo julọ’ ninu apo meta taxonomy nigba ti ko si awọn ohun ti o wa.','No %s found'=>'Ko si %s ti a ri','(e.g. &larr; Back to jobs'=>'(e.g. &larr; Pada si awọn iṣẹ','Back to Items'=>'Pada si Awọn nkan','The text displayed after a term has been updated for a link back to main index.'=>'Iwe ọrọ ti a fihan lẹhin ti a ti ṣe imudojuiwọn ọrọ fun ọna asopọ pada si itọsọna akọkọ.','Back to %s'=>'Pada si %s','Show in REST API'=>'Fihan ninu REST API','Add the taxonomy to the WordPress wp-json API.'=>'Fi taxonomy kun si WordPress wp-json API.','REST API base slug'=>'REST API ipilẹ slug','The base slug that this taxonomy will use in the REST API.'=>'Slug ipilẹ ti taxonomy yii yoo lo ninu REST API.','REST API controller class'=>'REST API oludari kilasi','The name of a custom Rest Controller class instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'Orukọ kilasi ti adani Rest Controller dipo WP_REST_Terms_Controller.','Custom controller to use instead of WP_REST_Terms_Controller.'=>'Oludari adani lati lo dipo WP_REST_Terms_Controller.','Public'=>'Gbogbo eniyan','The taxonomy is for public use. It can be seen by frontend users.'=>'Taxonomy yii jẹ fun lilo gbogbo eniyan. O le jẹri nipasẹ awọn olumulo iwaju.','Public Queryable'=>'Gbogbo eniyan Queryable','The taxonomy is publicly queryable.'=>'Taxonomy yii jẹ queryable gbogbogbo.','Query Var'=>'Query Var','Enable a custom query_var key for this taxonomy.'=>'Mu bọtini query_var adani ṣiṣẹ fun taxonomy yii.','Custom Query Var String'=>'Custom Query Var String','Sets a custom query_var slug for this taxonomy.'=>'Ṣeto slug query_var adani fun taxonomy yii.','Metabox callback'=>'Metabox ipe','Sets a callback function name for the meta box display. Hierarchical default: post_categories_meta_box, non-hierarchical default: post_tags_meta_box. To remove the metabox completely, use "false".'=>'Ṣeto orukọ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe isọdọtun fun ifihan apoti meta. Aiyipada hierarchial: post_categories_meta_box, aiyipada ti kii ṣe hierarchial: post_tags_meta_box. Lati yọ apoti meta patapata, lo "false".','Categories'=>'Ẹka','This feature controls the order of %s when you\'re editing posts, and in frontend displays.'=>'Ẹya yii n ṣakoso aṣẹ ti %s nigba ti o n satunkọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ, ati ni awọn ifihan iwaju.','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ aṣẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Enable PublishPress Taxonomies ordering for this taxonomy in the frontend and admin area.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ aṣẹ Taxonomies PublishPress fun taxonomy yii ni iwaju ati agbegbe admin.','Re-activate Taxonomy'=>'Tun-ṣiṣẹ Taxonomy','Deactivate Taxonomy'=>'Pa Taxonomy','Delete Taxonomy'=>'Paarẹ Taxonomy','Delete PublishPress Taxonomies Edit Data'=>'Paarẹ Data Iṣatunṣe Taxonomies PublishPress','You can only delete taxonomies created with PublishPress Taxonomies. However, you can delete any changes or edit made from PublishPress Taxonomies which will remove PublishPress Taxonomies version edit restoring original taxonomies data or removing it if already deleted'=>'O le paarẹ taxonomies ti a ṣẹda pẹlu Taxonomies PublishPress nikan. Sibẹsibẹ, o le paarẹ eyikeyi awọn ayipada tabi iṣatunkọ ti a ṣe lati Taxonomies PublishPress eyiti yoo yọ ẹya iṣatunkọ Taxonomies PublishPress pada si data taxonomies atilẹba tabi yọ rẹ ti o ba ti paarẹ tẹlẹ','Save Taxonomy'=>'Fipamọ Taxonomy','Add Taxonomy'=>'Fi Taxonomy kun','Term copied successfully.'=>'Term ti daakọ ni aṣeyọri.','Term deleted successfully.'=>'Term ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Term removed from all posts successfully.'=>'Term ti yọkuro lati gbogbo awọn ifiweranṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Synonyms'=>'Synonyms','Status'=>'Ipo','Copy'=>'Daakọ','Select Destination Taxonomy'=>'Yan Taxonomy Ibi-afẹde','Search posts'=>'Wa awọn ifiweranṣẹ','post type'=>'post type','Select Destination %s'=>'Yan Ibi-afẹde %s','Terms deleted successfully.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ti paarẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Term(s) copied successfully.'=>'Ọrọ(ọrọ) ti daakọ ni aṣeyọri.','Hidden'=>'Tẹ́lẹ̀','Live'=>'Gba laaye','No terms found.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ ti a rii.','Quick edit &#8220;%s&#8221; inline'=>'Ṣatunkọ yarayara &#8220;%s&#8221; inline','Quick&nbsp;Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ&nbsp;Yarayara','Remove From All Posts'=>'Yọ Kúrò Ninu Gbogbo Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ','Quick Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ Yarayara','This screen allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'Ibuwọlu yi gba ọ laaye lati wa ati ṣatunkọ gbogbo awọn ọrọ lori aaye rẹ.','This screen allows you to order terms via drag and drop.'=>'Ibo yi n gba ọ laaye lati paṣẹ awọn ọrọ nipasẹ gbigbe ati ju silẹ.','Search Terms'=>'Wa Awọn Ọrọ','Media Tags'=>'Awọn aami Media','Media Tag'=>'Aami Media','All Media Tags'=>'Gbogbo Awọn aami Media','Edit Media Tag'=>'Ṣatunkọ Aami Media','View Media Tag'=>'Wo Aami Media','Update Media Tag name'=>'Mẹta orukọ Aami Media','Add new Media Tag'=>'Fi Aami Media tuntun kun','New Media Tag name'=>'Orukọ Aami Media Tuntun','Parent Media Tag'=>'Aami Media Obi','Parent Media Tag:'=>'Aami Media Obi:','Search Media Tags'=>'Wa Awọn aami Media','Popular Media Tags'=>'Awọn aami Media Ti o gbajumọ','Separate Media Tags with commas'=>'Ya Awọn aami Media pẹlu awọn koma','Add or remove Media Tags'=>'Fi tabi yọ Awọn aami Media','Choose from the most used Media Tags'=>'Yan lati inu awọn aami Media ti a lo julọ','No Media Tags found'=>'Ko si Awọn aami Media ti a rii','No Media Tags'=>'Ko si Awọn aami Media','Media Tags list navigation'=>'Iṣakoso atokọ Awọn aami Media','Media Tags list'=>'Atokọ Awọn afi Media','Back to Media Tags'=>'Padà si Awọn afi Media','PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Search PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Wa Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Edit PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Ṣatunkọ Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Update PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Mọ́lẹ̀ Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress','Add New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Fikun-un Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress Tuntun','New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'Awọn igbasilẹ Taxonomies PublishPress Tuntun','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free. The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'O n lo Taxonomies PublishPress Free. Version Pro ni awọn ẹya diẹ sii ati atilẹyin.','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'Gba Version Pro ti Taxonomies PublishPress','Enhance the power of PublishPress Taxonomies with the Pro version:'=>'Mu agbara ti Taxonomies PublishPress pọ pẹlu version Pro:','Unlimited “Term Display”'=>'“Iṣafihan Ọrọ” ailopin','Unlimited “Terms for Current Posts”'=>'“Awọn Ọrọ fun Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ lọwọlọwọ” ailopin','Unlimited “Related Posts”'=>'“Awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti o ni ibatan” ailopin','Unlimited “Auto Links”'=>'“Awọn ọna asopọ aifọwọyi” ailopin','Unlimited “Auto Terms”'=>'“Awọn Ọrọ aifọwọyi” ailopin','Create new terms using OpenAI and other sources'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ọrọ tuntun nipa lilo OpenAI ati awọn orisun miiran','Use Linked Terms'=>'Lo Awọn Ọrọ Ti o Ni Asopọ','Use Synonyms'=>'Lo Awọn Ọrọ Itumọ','Schedule Auto Terms to run automatically'=>'Gbero Awọn Ọrọ aifọwọyi lati ṣiṣẹ laifọwọyi','Control the display of term metaboxes'=>'Ṣakoso ifihan ti term metaboxes','Fast, professional support'=>'Atilẹyin iyara, ọjọgbọn','No ads inside the plugin'=>'Ko si ipolowo ninu plugin','Need PublishPress Taxonomies Support?'=>'Ṣe o nilo Atilẹyin PublishPress Taxonomies?','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'Ti o ba nilo iranlọwọ tabi ni ibeere ẹya tuntun, jẹ ki a mọ.','Request Support'=>'Beere Atilẹyin','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ alaye wa ni oju opo wẹẹbu plugin naa.','View Knowledge Base'=>'Wo Ibi imọ','OpenAI Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ OpenAI','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate OpenAI to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ OpenAI lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','IBM Watson Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ IBM Watson','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Watson to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ Watson lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','Dandelion Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ Dandelion','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Dandelion to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ Dandelion lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','LSEG / Refinitiv Integration'=>'Iṣọpọ LSEG / Refinitiv','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate LSEG / Refinitiv to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati darapọ LSEG / Refinitiv lati ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ.','Suggest terms using AI'=>'Daba awọn ọrọ nipa lilo AI','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati daba awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo OpenAI. Iṣẹ yii le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ tuntun.','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the IBM Watson. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati daba awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo IBM Watson. Iṣẹ yii le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ tuntun.','Copy with Metadata'=>'Daakọ pẹlu Metadata','Auto Terms using AI Connectors'=>'Awọn ọrọ aifọwọyi nipa lilo AI Connectors','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro can generate terms using any compatible AI provider configured in Settings > Connectors.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro le ṣẹda awọn ọrọ nipa lilo eyikeyi olupese AI ti o baamu ti a ṣeto ni Awọn Eto > Connectors.','Auto terms using AI'=>'Awọn ọrọ aiyipada nipa lilo AI','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to generate new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and add new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo awọn iṣẹ OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion ati Open Calais. Awọn iṣẹ wọnyi le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si fi awọn ọrọ tuntun kun.','Additional taxonomies'=>'Awọn taxonomies afikun','Select additional taxonomies...'=>'Yan awọn taxonomies afikun...','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request.'=>'Ṣe ilọsiwaju si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro lati ṣẹda awọn ọrọ oriṣiriṣi fun awọn taxonomies pupọ ni ibeere OpenAI kan.','Generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn ọrọ oriṣiriṣi fun awọn taxonomies pupọ ni ibeere OpenAI kan.','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati daba awọn ọrọ tuntun fun akoonu rẹ nipa lilo awọn iṣẹ OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion ati Open Calais. Awọn iṣẹ wọnyi le ṣe itupalẹ akoonu rẹ ki o si daba awọn ọrọ tuntun.','Add Custom Elements'=>'Ṣafikun Awọn eroja Aṣ customized','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ni iṣakoso pipe lori ibiti a ti fi Awọn ọna asopọ Aiyipada kun. O le yan lati fo awọn eroja HTML ti o han ninu akoonu rẹ.','Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms'=>'Lo Awọn ifaminsi deede lati yi Awọn ọrọ Aiyipada pada','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use this feature.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati yi bi Awọn ọrọ Aiyipada ṣe n ṣe itupalẹ awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ. Iwọ yoo nilo lati mọ bi a ṣe le kọ Awọn ifaminsi deede lati lo ẹya yii.','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also.'=>'Ẹya yii n gba ọ laaye lati so awọn ọrọ pọ. Nigbati ọrọ akọkọ tabi eyikeyi ninu awọn ọrọ wọnyi ba fi kun si ifiweranṣẹ, gbogbo awọn ọrọ miiran yoo tun fi kun.','Linked Terms Feature'=>'Ẹya Awọn ọrọ asopọ','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization across your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ṣẹda awọn asopọ to lagbara laarin awọn ọrọ rẹ. Nigbati a ba fi ọrọ kan kun si ifiweranṣẹ, awọn ọrọ asopọ rẹ le fi kun laifọwọyi. Eyi n ṣe iranlọwọ lati ṣetọju iṣeto to ni ibamu ni gbogbo akoonu rẹ.','This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For example, "website" can have synonyms such as "websites", "web site", and "web pages".'=>'Ẹya yi n gba ọ laaye lati so awọn ọrọ afikun pọ pẹlu ọkọọkan ọrọ. Fun apẹẹrẹ, "weebụsaịtị" le ni awọn ọrọ aiyipada bii "weebụsaịtị", "weebụ aaye", ati "weebụ oju-iwe".','Synonyms Terms Feature'=>'Ẹya Awọn ọrọ aiyipada','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro n gba ọ laaye lati ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ọrọ ti a so pọ pẹlu ọrọ kan. Ti PublishPress Taxonomies ba ṣe iwadii akoonu rẹ ki o si ri ọrọ aiyipada, yoo ṣiṣẹ bi ẹnipe o ti ri ọrọ akọkọ.','Taxonomy Display'=>'Ifihan Taxonomy','This feature is available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'Ẹya yii wa ni PublishPress Taxonomies Pro','Customize the display of terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'Ṣatunkọ ifihan awọn ọrọ ninu metabox PublishPress Taxonomies.','Options include checkboxes and a dropdown list.'=>'Awọn aṣayan pẹlu awọn apoti ayẹwo ati atokọ dropdown.','Copy Term with Metadata'=>'Daakọ Ọrọ pẹlu Metadata','To Copy terms with their metadata, please upgrade to pro.'=>'Lati Daakọ awọn ọrọ pẹlu metadata wọn, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn si pro.','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent organization across your site.'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, o le daakọ awọn ọrọ taxonomy pọ pẹlu gbogbo metadata wọn. Eyi pẹlu awọn apejuwe ọrọ, awọn aworan, ati awọn aaye aṣa. O le daakọ awọn ọrọ laarin awọn taxonomy lati ṣetọju iṣeto to ni ibamu ni gbogbo aaye rẹ.','Choose the display formats of your terms, options include table list, ordered list, border-cloud and lots more.'=>'Yan awọn ọna kika ifihan ti awọn ọrọ rẹ, awọn aṣayan pẹlu atokọ tabili, atokọ ti a paṣẹ, awọ-ọwọ ati ọpọlọpọ diẹ sii.','Hourly'=>'Lọ́ọ́rẹ́','Daily'=>'Ọjọ́','Pro Feature'=>'Ẹ̀ya Pro','Some of these features are available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn ẹya wọnyi wa ni PublishPress Taxonomies Pro','ID'=>'ID','Name (Pro)'=>'Orukọ (Pro)','Counter (Pro)'=>'Kọ́ńtà (Pro)','Random (Pro)'=>'Aiyé (Pro)','Term Order (Pro)'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ (Pro)','Order terms for display by'=>'Pade awọn ọrọ fun ifihan nipasẹ','Term Order'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ','Disabled'=>'Ti a dènà','You have disabled PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'O ti dènà awọn aṣẹ PublishPress Taxonomies','Terms in this taxonomy are ordered by %s'=>'Awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy yii ni a paṣẹ nipasẹ %s','Term Order(Pro)'=>'Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ (Pro)','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to use Term Order to manually order Terms'=>'Ṣatunkọ si PublishPress Taxonomies Pro lati lo Ẹ̀tọ́ Ọrọ lati paṣẹ awọn ọrọ ni ọwọ','The provider request was not sent.'=>'Ibeere olupese ko ti ranṣẹ.','Result from api.'=>'Abajade lati api.','Request completed.'=>'Ìbéèrè ti pari.','Security error. Kindly reload this page and try again'=>'Aṣiṣe aabo. Jọwọ tun gbe oju-iwe yi ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi','Permission error. You do not have permission to manage PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'Aṣiṣe igbanilaaye. Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso PublishPress Taxonomies','Posts content and title is empty.'=>'Akopọ ati akọle awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti ṣofo.','Permission error. You do not have permission to preview this post.'=>'Aṣiṣe igbanilaaye. Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati wo ifiweranṣẹ yi.','You do not have permission to manage this taxonomy. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso taxonomy yi. Mu Metabox Access Taxonomies ṣiṣẹ fun ipa yi ni %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.','Too many AI preview requests. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'Ọpọ awọn ibeere AI ti o yẹwo. Jọwọ duro fun iṣẹju kan ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Term Results'=>'Awọn Abajade Ọrọ','No results found for this post with this taxonomy.'=>'Ko si awọn abajade ti a ri fun ifiweranṣẹ yi pẹlu taxonomy yi.','Invalid Auto Term ID. Please save the settings before using preview.'=>'ID Ọrọ Aifọwọyi ti ko tọ. Jọwọ fipamọ awọn eto ṣaaju lilo iwoye.','You must enable at least one AI integration source to use auto term preview.'=>'O gbọdọ mu orisun iṣọpọ AI kan ṣiṣẹ o kere ju lati lo iwoye ọrọ aifọwọyi.','This Auto Terms option is not enabled for metaboxes. Please enable it in the Auto Terms settings.'=>'Yiyan Ọrọ Aifọwọyi yi ko ti mu ṣiṣẹ fun metaboxes. Jọwọ mu ṣiṣẹ ni awọn eto Ọrọ Aifọwọyi.','Click %1s to select or deselect them from this %2s.'=>'Tẹ %1s lati yan tabi yọ wọn kuro ninu %2s yi.','Suggest Existing Terms'=>'Ṣe iṣeduro Awọn Ọrọ to wa','AI Connectors: %s'=>'AI Connectors: %s','Update %1s on this %2s'=>'Imudojuiwọn %1s lori %2s yi','Existing Terms not found for the selected post type and taxonomies'=>'Ko si Awọn Ọrọ to wa ti a ri fun iru ifiweranṣẹ ti a ti yan ati taxonomies','Existing Terms taxonomy is required. Kindly select taxonomies and save the settings before running preview.'=>'Taxonomy Awọn Ọrọ to wa jẹ dandan. Jọwọ yan awọn taxonomy ki o si fipamọ awọn eto ṣaaju ṣiṣe iwoye.','Result from ajax request.'=>'Abajade lati ibeere ajax.','The selected taxonomy is not associated with the selected post type.'=>'Taxonomy ti a yan ko ni asopọ pẹlu post type ti a yan.','No results found for this taxonomy.'=>'Ko si abajade ti a ri fun taxonomy yii.','You do not have permission to edit this post.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati satunkọ post yii.','You do not have permission to assign terms from this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati yan awọn ọrọ lati taxonomy yii.','Click Term to select or deselect from this %1s'=>'Tẹ Term lati yan tabi yọ jade lati %1s yii','Both Taxonomy and Post are required.'=>'Mejeeji Taxonomy ati Post ni a beere.','No new terms were selected or deselected.'=>'Ko si awọn ọrọ tuntun ti a yan tabi yọ jade.','%1s terms added to this %2s.'=>'%1s awọn ọrọ ti wa ni afikun si %2s yii.','%1s terms removed from this %2s.'=>'%1s awọn ọrọ ti wa ni yọ kuro ninu %2s yii.','You do not have capability to manage this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni agbara lati ṣakoso taxonomy yii.','You do not have permission to edit this post with this taxonomy.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati satunkọ post yii pẹlu taxonomy yii.','Terms cannot contain the following characters: %s'=>'Awọn ọrọ ko le ni awọn ohun kikọ wọnyi: %s','Terms must be at least %d characters long.'=>'Awọn ọrọ gbọdọ jẹ o kere ju %d awọn ohun kikọ.','Terms cannot exceed %d characters.'=>'Awọn ọrọ ko le kọja %d awọn ohun kikọ.','The Dandelion integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Isopọ Dandelion ti wa ni pipade ni awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','No matched result from the API Server.'=>'Ko si abajade ti o baamu lati API Server.','The Dandelion integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Isopọ Dandelion nilo API Key. Jọwọ fi API Key rẹ kun ni awọn eto Auto Term.','Selected content is empty.'=>'Ayanfẹ akoonu jẹ ofo.','Result from cache.'=>'Abajade lati cache.','API Error: %1s.'=>'API Aṣiṣe: %1s.','Empty response.'=>'Idahun ofo.','Error establishing connection with the API server. Try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe ti o ṣẹda asopọ pẹlu olupin API. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ LSEG / Refinitiv ti wa ni pipade ninu awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ LSEG / Refinitiv nilo Bọtini API. Jọwọ fi Bọtini API rẹ kun ninu awọn eto Auto Term.','API Error: No matched result for content.'=>'API Aṣiṣe: Ko si abajade ti o baamu fun akoonu.','The IBM Watson integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ IBM Watson ti wa ni pipade ninu awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','The IBM Watson integration requires an API Key and URL. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ IBM Watson nilo Bọtini API ati URL. Jọwọ fi Bọtini API rẹ kun ninu awọn eto Auto Term.','The IBM Watson API URL must use HTTPS and an official Natural Language Understanding service hostname.'=>'URL API IBM Watson gbọdọ lo HTTPS ati orukọ olupin iṣẹ oye ede adayeba osise.','No matched result from an AI Connector.'=>'Ko si abajade ti o baamu lati ọdọ AI Connector.','AI Connectors require WordPress 7.0 or newer.'=>'AI Connectors nilo WordPress 7.0 tabi tuntun si.','Invalid placeholder(s) detected: {%s}. Valid placeholders are: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}'=>'Iboju ti ko tọ (s) ti a ri: {%s}. Awọn iboju ti o wulo ni: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}','You added {post_terms} in the prompt but your post does not contain any terms.'=>'O ti fi {post_terms} kun ninu iwifunni ṣugbọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ ko ni awọn ọrọ kankan.','You added {site_terms} in the prompt but your site does not contain any terms for this taxonomy.'=>'O ti fi {site_terms} kun ninu iwifunni ṣugbọn aaye rẹ ko ni awọn ọrọ kankan fun taxonomy yii.','No compatible AI provider is configured. Install and configure a provider in Settings > Connectors.'=>'Ko si olupese AI ti o baamu ti a ṣeto. Fi sori ẹrọ ati tunto olupese ni Awọn Eto > Connectors.','Result from an AI Connector.'=>'Abajade lati ọdọ AI Connector.','The direct OpenAI integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'Isopọ taara OpenAI ti wa ni pipade ni awọn eto Legacy AI Sources.','The OpenAI integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Iṣọpọ OpenAI nilo Bọtini API. Jọwọ fi Bọtini API rẹ kun ninu awọn eto Auto Term.','Error: OpenAI says there is an issue with this API key. Please check your plan or billing details.'=>'Aṣiṣe: OpenAI sọ pe iṣoro kan wa pẹlu bọtini API yii. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo eto rẹ tabi awọn alaye isanwo.','View Existing Terms'=>'Wo Awọn Ọrọ Tẹlẹ','This feature allows you to browse all the terms in a taxonomy.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati wa gbogbo awọn ọrọ ninu taxonomy kan.','View Current Post Terms'=>'Wo Awọn Ọrọ Ifiweranṣẹ Tí Ó Wà Lọwọlọwọ','This feature allows you to manage all the terms that are currently attached to a post.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣakoso gbogbo awọn ọrọ ti a so mọ ifiweranṣẹ kan ni lọwọlọwọ.','View Terms'=>'Wo Awọn Ọrọ','This feature allows you to browse based on selected auto terms settings and sources.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣawari da lori awọn eto ọrọ aifọwọyi ti a yan ati awọn orisun.','Suggest Terms'=>'Ṣe Iṣeduro Awọn Ọrọ','Select all %1s'=>'Yan gbogbo %1s','Deselect all %1s'=>'Yọ gbogbo %1s','Select %1s'=>'Yan %1s','Please choose a post to use with PublishPress Taxonomies AI.'=>'Jọwọ yan ifiweranṣẹ kan lati lo pẹlu PublishPress Taxonomies AI.','Label can\'t be empty.'=>'Aami ko le ṣofo.','Label can\'t exceed 30 characters.'=>'Aami ko le kọja awọn ohun kikọ 30.','Unknown tab type.'=>'Iru taabu ti a ko mọ.','Error saving label.'=>'Aṣiṣe fipamọ aami.','Please choose a post to preview.'=>'Jọwọ yan ifiweranṣẹ kan lati ṣe atunyẹwo.','Metabox Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Metabox','This feature allows you to customize the metabox interface you see when adding terms to posts.'=>'Ẹya yii gba ọ laaye lati ṣe akanṣe oju-iṣẹ metabox ti o rii nigbati o ba n ṣafikun awọn ọrọ si awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Save Changes'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Iyipada','Select %s'=>'Yan %s','Invalid request.'=>'Ibéèrè tí kò tọ́.','There\'s no content to scan.'=>'Kò sí akoonu kankan láti ṣayẹwo.','There are no terms that are relevant to your content.'=>'Kò sí ìpín kankan tí ó ní ibatan pẹ̀lú akoonu rẹ.','This user does not have access to manage any of this post attached taxonomies. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'Olùmúlò yìí kò ní irú ẹ̀tọ́ kankan láti ṣàkóso eyikeyi nínú àwọn taxonomies tí a so mọ́ ìkàwé yìí. Ṣíṣe Metabox Access Taxonomies fún ipa yìí ní %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.','No PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox features are enabled for this post type.'=>'Kò sí àwọn ẹya Metabox PublishPress Taxonomies tí a ti ṣe é fún irú ìkàwé yìí.','Rename tab'=>'Tun orukọ taabu','Save, You can also press Enter to save and escape to cancel'=>'Fipamọ́, O tún le tẹ Enter láti fi pamọ́ àti Escape láti fagile','Search existing terms'=>'Wa awọn ọrọ to wa','Search Terms...'=>'Wá Àmì...','Create term'=>'Ṣẹda ọrọ','Create Term'=>'Ṣẹda Àmì','You do not have the required capabilities to manage any of this post attached taxonomies.'=>'Iwọ kò ní àwọn agbara tí a nílò láti ṣàkóso eyikeyi nínú àwọn taxonomies tí a so mọ́ ìkàwé yìí.','You can not edit this label.'=>'Iwọ kò le ṣatunkọ́ àkọlé yìí.','Invalid nonce token.'=>'Ibi tí a fi ẹ̀tọ́ kankan jẹ́ àìtó.','Label is too long.'=>'Àkọlé náà pẹ́ ju.','Hey, you\'ve been using PublishPress Taxonomies for %s on your site. We hope the plugin has been useful. Please could you quickly leave a 5-star rating on WordPress.org? It really does help to keep PublishPress Taxonomies growing.'=>'Hey, o ti n lo PublishPress Taxonomies fún %s lórí aaye rẹ. A nireti pé àfikún náà ti wúlò. Jọ̀wọ́, ṣe o le fi ìtẹ́wọ́gbà irawọ̀ 5 sí WordPress.org ní kíákíá? Ó ṣeé ṣe kó ràn wá lọwọ lati jẹ́ kí PublishPress Taxonomies máa dàgbà.','1 week'=>'1 ọ̀sẹ̀','3 months'=>'3 oṣù','Click here to add your rating for PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'Tẹ nibi lati fi iwọn didun rẹ kun fun PublishPress Taxonomies','Maybe later'=>'Boya nigbamii','I already did'=>'Mo ti ṣe tẹlẹ','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'A le pa afikun yii run.','PublishPress Taxonomies was not activated because PublishPress Taxonomies Pro is already active. Please keep only PublishPress Taxonomies Pro enabled.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies ko ti mu ṣiṣẹ nitori PublishPress Taxonomies Pro ti wa ni iṣẹ tẹlẹ. Jọwọ pa PublishPress Taxonomies Pro nikan ṣiṣẹ.','term nameName'=>'Orukọ','term nameTaxonomy'=>'taxonomy']];